window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/courses/a431-fb7c28a0e247fd46.json"]={sha256:"fb7c28a0e247fd46c7f51a8955ad9790ea737067a7d8e40886ca9e2ba6d56069",value:{"id":"a431","title":"傅立葉轉換紅外光譜儀","titleEn":"Fourier-transform infrared spectrometers","category":"instruments","kind":"course","status":"guided","contentStatus":"reviewable-educational-curriculum","summary":"從干涉圖與傅立葉轉換的關係出發，理解動鏡行程如何決定解析度、氦氖雷射條紋如何定義波數軸與取樣，再把分光鏡、光源、偵測器、光闌與吹掃整合成可驗收的紅外光譜儀；聚苯乙烯標準片與 100% 線測試是全課的量測主軸。","summaryEn":"Starting from the interferogram–spectrum Fourier pair, this course shows how mirror travel sets resolution, how HeNe laser fringes define the wavenumber axis and sampling, and how beamsplitter, source, detector, aperture stop and purge combine into an acceptable infrared spectrometer; the polystyrene standard and the 100% line test are the measurement backbone throughout.","scope":"依公開物理原理與官方資料編寫的原創教學；步驟是可驗證的學習任務與假想算例，不是原廠配方、施工圖、設備操作許可或安全程序。數值均為教學假設，需依實際規格重算。","scopeEn":"Original teaching built from public physics and official sources. Steps are verifiable learning tasks and hypothetical exercises, not vendor recipes, construction drawings, operating authorisation or safety procedures. Numbers are teaching assumptions and must be recalculated for real specifications.","subcategory":"optics-spectroscopy-radiometry","subcategoryTitle":"光譜與輻射量測","subcategoryTitleEn":"Spectroscopy and radiometry","learningTrack":"optics","learningSubdiscipline":"optics-spectroscopy-radiometry","learningTags":["optics","optics-spectroscopy-radiometry","interferometer"],"architectureFamily":"interferometer","architectureNodes":[["碳化矽紅外光源","Silicon-carbide infrared source"],["麥克森干涉儀與 KBr/Ge 分光鏡","Michelson interferometer with KBr/Ge beamsplitter"],["氦氖參考雷射與零交越取樣","HeNe reference laser and zero-crossing sampling"],["吹掃樣品室與附件","Purged sample compartment and accessories"],["DTGS/MCT 偵測器","DTGS/MCT detector"],["ADC 與傅立葉轉換處理","ADC and Fourier-transform processing"]],"architectureEdges":[[0,1],[1,3],[3,4],[4,5],[2,1],[2,5]],"diagram":{"type":"interferometer","labels":["碳化矽紅外光源","麥克森干涉儀與 KBr/Ge 分光鏡","氦氖參考雷射與零交越取樣","吹掃樣品室與附件","DTGS/MCT 偵測器"],"labelsEn":["Silicon-carbide infrared source","Michelson interferometer with KBr/Ge beamsplitter","HeNe reference laser and zero-crossing sampling","Purged sample compartment and accessories","DTGS/MCT detector"],"original":true,"notToScale":true},"workedExample":{"title":"原創假想算例與邊界","titleEn":"Original hypothetical example and boundaries","text":"量測規劃練習：目標解析度 2 cm⁻¹、範圍 4000–400 cm⁻¹、KBr/Ge 分光鏡、DTGS 偵測器。最大光程差 Δ_max = 1/2 = 0.5 cm，動鏡行程 2.5 mm；取樣間隔 632.8 nm（每隔一個零交越）給奈奎斯特 7899 cm⁻¹，單邊點數 N = 0.5/632.8×10⁻⁷ ≈ 7900，雙邊約 15800 點，補零到 32768 點做 FFT。光程差速度 0.6329 cm/s 時一次雙邊掃描 2×0.5/0.6329 ≈ 1.58 s，64 次掃描約 101 s。雅基諾光闌：R = 4000/2 = 2000，Ω = 2π/2000 = 3.14×10⁻³ sr，θ = √(Ω/π) = 0.0316 rad，焦距 100 mm 下光闌直徑 6.3 mm；光闌引起的刻度偏移 −θ²/4 = −2.5×10⁻⁴，在 2849.5 cm⁻¹ 為 −0.71 cm⁻¹，由有效雷射波數校正吸收。雜訊：若 32 次掃描的 100% 線均方根為 1×10⁻⁴，64 次約 7.1×10⁻⁵，吸光度雜訊 ≈ 0.434×7.1×10⁻⁵ ≈ 3.1×10⁻⁵ AU，三倍偵測極限約 9×10⁻⁵ AU。所有數值皆為教學假設，不代表任何機型規格。","textEn":"Measurement-planning exercise: target resolution 2 cm⁻¹, range 4000–400 cm⁻¹, KBr/Ge beamsplitter, DTGS detector. The maximum path difference is Δ_max = 1/2 = 0.5 cm, mirror travel 2.5 mm; a 632.8 nm sampling interval (every second zero crossing) gives a 7899 cm⁻¹ Nyquist limit, N = 0.5/632.8×10⁻⁷ ≈ 7900 points per side, about 15800 double-sided, zero-filled to 32768 for the FFT. At a path-difference velocity of 0.6329 cm/s one double-sided scan takes 2×0.5/0.6329 ≈ 1.58 s and 64 scans about 101 s. Jacquinot stop: R = 4000/2 = 2000, Ω = 2π/2000 = 3.14×10⁻³ sr, θ = √(Ω/π) = 0.0316 rad, stop diameter 6.3 mm at 100 mm focal length; the aperture-induced scale shift is −θ²/4 = −2.5×10⁻⁴, i.e. −0.71 cm⁻¹ at 2849.5 cm⁻¹, absorbed by the effective-laser-wavenumber calibration. Noise: if the 32-scan 100% line RMS is 1×10⁻⁴, 64 scans give about 7.1×10⁻⁵, an absorbance noise of ≈ 0.434×7.1×10⁻⁵ ≈ 3.1×10⁻⁵ AU and a three-sigma detection limit near 9×10⁻⁵ AU. All values are teaching assumptions, not any model's specification.","assumptions":"數值是本課自行設定的教學假設，不代表實機量測、產品額定或操作參數；改變系統邊界後必須重算。","assumptionsEn":"Inputs are teaching assumptions, not measured hardware, product ratings or operating parameters; recalculate after changing the system boundary.","sourceScope":"原創數值練習；來源支援公開原理與設施背景，不宣稱來源提供這組數據。","sourceScopeEn":"Original numerical exercise; sources support public principles and facility context, not these numbers."},"depth":4,"languageCoverage":["zh-TW","en"],"simulationOnly":true,"educationEdition":12,"enrichmentVersion":12,"stages":[{"id":"a431-v12-s1","title":"系統邊界與物理原理","titleEn":"System boundaries and physical principles","description":"本階段聚焦「干涉圖與光譜的傅立葉對」與「解析度、切趾與通量優勢」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"The interferogram–spectrum Fourier pair\" and \"Resolution, apodization and the throughput advantage\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a431-v12-01","title":"干涉圖與光譜的傅立葉對：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"The interferogram–spectrum Fourier pair: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"],"prerequisiteIds":[],"objective":"說明「麥克森干涉儀與干涉圖」如何決定傅立葉轉換紅外光譜儀的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Michelson interferometer and interferogram” determines the key performance of “Fourier-transform infrared spectrometers”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"FTIR 不用光柵分光，而是讓紅外光進入麥克森干涉儀：分光鏡把光分成兩路，一路到固定鏡、一路到以等速移動的動鏡，兩路重合後的強度隨光程差 x 變化，形成干涉圖 I(x) = ∫B(ν̃)cos(2πν̃x)dν̃。每個波數 ν̃ 的光在動鏡掃描時都以自己的頻率 f = 2v·ν̃ 被調變（v 為動鏡速度、2v 為光程差速度），所有波數同時被偵測器記錄，再用傅立葉轉換把干涉圖還原成光譜 B(ν̃)。這就是費爾蓋特多工優勢的來源：整個掃描時間內每個波數都在累積訊號，而不是像色散式儀器逐一通過狹縫。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「麥克森干涉儀與干涉圖」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Instead of dispersing light with a grating, an FTIR sends the infrared beam into a Michelson interferometer: the beamsplitter divides it toward a fixed mirror and a mirror moving at constant velocity, and the recombined intensity varies with optical path difference x as the interferogram I(x) = ∫B(ν̃)cos(2πν̃x)dν̃. Each wavenumber ν̃ is modulated at its own audio frequency f = 2v·ν̃ (v the mirror velocity, 2v the path-difference velocity), all wavenumbers reach the detector simultaneously, and a Fourier transform recovers the spectrum B(ν̃). This is the Fellgett multiplex advantage: every spectral element accumulates signal for the whole scan rather than taking turns through a slit. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Michelson interferometer and interferogram”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：取光程差速度 2v = 0.6329 cm/s（常見設定，此處為教學假設），波數 1000 cm⁻¹ 的光被調變在 f = 0.6329×1000 ≈ 633 Hz；4000 cm⁻¹ 在約 2.5 kHz；氦氖參考雷射 15798 cm⁻¹ 則在約 10 kHz。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: With a path-difference velocity 2v = 0.6329 cm/s (a common setting, used here as a teaching assumption), light at 1000 cm⁻¹ is modulated at f = 0.6329×1000 ≈ 633 Hz, 4000 cm⁻¹ at about 2.5 kHz, and the HeNe reference at 15798 cm⁻¹ near 10 kHz; the detector and preamplifier bandwidth must cover this whole audio band or the high-wavenumber end is attenuated.","failure":"常見誤解：「FTIR 是用某種精密光柵把紅外光分成各個波長後逐一量測。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"An FTIR uses a fine grating to separate the infrared wavelengths and measures them one at a time.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「麥克森干涉儀與干涉圖」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Michelson interferometer and interferogram”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a431-v12-01-k1","title":"干涉圖與光譜的傅立葉對","titleEn":"The interferogram–spectrum Fourier pair","text":"FTIR 不用光柵分光，而是讓紅外光進入麥克森干涉儀：分光鏡把光分成兩路，一路到固定鏡、一路到以等速移動的動鏡，兩路重合後的強度隨光程差 x 變化，形成干涉圖 I(x) = ∫B(ν̃)cos(2πν̃x)dν̃。每個波數 ν̃ 的光在動鏡掃描時都以自己的頻率 f = 2v·ν̃ 被調變（v 為動鏡速度、2v 為光程差速度），所有波數同時被偵測器記錄，再用傅立葉轉換把干涉圖還原成光譜 B(ν̃)。","textEn":"Instead of dispersing light with a grating, an FTIR sends the infrared beam into a Michelson interferometer: the beamsplitter divides it toward a fixed mirror and a mirror moving at constant velocity, and the recombined intensity varies with optical path difference x as the interferogram I(x) = ∫B(ν̃)cos(2πν̃x)dν̃. Each wavenumber ν̃ is modulated at its own audio frequency f = 2v·ν̃ (v the mirror velocity, 2v the path-difference velocity), all wavenumbers reach the detector simultaneously, and a Fourier transform recovers the spectrum B(ν̃).","sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"]},{"id":"a431-v12-01-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：FTIR 是用某種精密光柵把紅外光分成各個波長後逐一量測。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: An FTIR uses a fine grating to separate the infrared wavelengths and measures them one at a time. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「干涉圖與光譜的傅立葉對」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"The interferogram–spectrum Fourier pair\" is correct?","options":["FTIR 是用某種精密光柵把紅外光分成各個波長後逐一量測。","FTIR 不用光柵分光，而是讓紅外光進入麥克森干涉儀：分光鏡把光分成兩路，一路到固定鏡、一路到以等速移動的動鏡，兩路重合後的強度隨光程差 x 變化，形成干涉圖 I(x) = ∫B(ν̃)cos(2πν̃x)dν̃。","動鏡走得越遠，解析度就無限提高，與光闌大小無關。"],"optionsEn":["An FTIR uses a fine grating to separate the infrared wavelengths and measures them one at a time.","Instead of dispersing light with a grating, an FTIR sends the infrared beam into a Michelson interferometer: the beamsplitter divides it toward a fixed mirror and a mirror moving at constant velocity, and the recombined intensity varies with optical path difference x as the interferogram I(x) = ∫B(ν̃)cos(2πν̃x)dν̃.","Longer mirror travel keeps improving resolution indefinitely, regardless of aperture size."],"answer":1,"explanation":"FTIR 不用光柵分光，而是讓紅外光進入麥克森干涉儀：分光鏡把光分成兩路，一路到固定鏡、一路到以等速移動的動鏡，兩路重合後的強度隨光程差 x 變化，形成干涉圖 I(x) = ∫B(ν̃)cos(2πν̃x)dν̃。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Instead of dispersing light with a grating, an FTIR sends the infrared beam into a Michelson interferometer: the beamsplitter divides it toward a fixed mirror and a mirror moving at constant velocity, and the recombined intensity varies with optical path difference x as the interferogram I(x) = ∫B(ν̃)cos(2πν̃x)dν̃. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":1},{"id":"a431-v12-02","title":"干涉圖與光譜的傅立葉對：定量估算","titleEn":"The interferogram–spectrum Fourier pair: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"],"prerequisiteIds":["a431-v12-01"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「麥克森干涉儀與干涉圖」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Michelson interferometer and interferogram” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：取光程差速度 2v = 0.6329 cm/s（常見設定，此處為教學假設），波數 1000 cm⁻¹ 的光被調變在 f = 0.6329×1000 ≈ 633 Hz；4000 cm⁻¹ 在約 2.5 kHz；氦氖參考雷射 15798 cm⁻¹ 則在約 10 kHz。偵測器與前置放大器的頻寬必須涵蓋整個音頻帶，否則高波數端會被衰減。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: With a path-difference velocity 2v = 0.6329 cm/s (a common setting, used here as a teaching assumption), light at 1000 cm⁻¹ is modulated at f = 0.6329×1000 ≈ 633 Hz, 4000 cm⁻¹ at about 2.5 kHz, and the HeNe reference at 15798 cm⁻¹ near 10 kHz; the detector and preamplifier bandwidth must cover this whole audio band or the high-wavenumber end is attenuated. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：在儀器診斷模式觀察干涉圖：中心爆（centre burst）的峰值電壓應落在 ADC 量程的 30–70%，單光束光譜在 2000 cm⁻¹ 附近的能量應與出廠基準相符；接著以示波器或診斷軟體檢查氦氖條紋頻率是否約為 10 kHz，確認動鏡速度與調變頻率的對應關係。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: In the instrument diagnostic mode inspect the interferogram: the centre-burst peak should sit at 30–70% of the ADC range, and the single-beam energy near 2000 cm⁻¹ should match the factory baseline; then check with an oscilloscope or the diagnostic software that the HeNe fringe frequency is close to 10 kHz, confirming the mirror velocity and the modulation-frequency mapping.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a431-v12-02-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"取光程差速度 2v = 0.6329 cm/s（常見設定，此處為教學假設），波數 1000 cm⁻¹ 的光被調變在 f = 0.6329×1000 ≈ 633 Hz；4000 cm⁻¹ 在約 2.5 kHz；氦氖參考雷射 15798 cm⁻¹ 則在約 10 kHz。偵測器與前置放大器的頻寬必須涵蓋整個音頻帶，否則高波數端會被衰減。","textEn":"With a path-difference velocity 2v = 0.6329 cm/s (a common setting, used here as a teaching assumption), light at 1000 cm⁻¹ is modulated at f = 0.6329×1000 ≈ 633 Hz, 4000 cm⁻¹ at about 2.5 kHz, and the HeNe reference at 15798 cm⁻¹ near 10 kHz; the detector and preamplifier bandwidth must cover this whole audio band or the high-wavenumber end is attenuated.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"]},{"id":"a431-v12-02-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「干涉圖與光譜的傅立葉對」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"The interferogram–spectrum Fourier pair\", which statement holds?","options":["氦氖雷射只是幫動鏡對準用的，對波數準確度沒有影響。","解析度越高光譜越好，掃描次數只是為了美觀。","取光程差速度 2v = 0.6329 cm/s（常見設定，此處為教學假設），波數 1000 cm⁻¹ 的光被調變在 f = 0.6329×1000 ≈ 633 Hz。"],"optionsEn":["The HeNe laser only helps align the moving mirror and has no effect on wavenumber accuracy.","Higher resolution always gives a better spectrum, and scan averaging is merely cosmetic.","With a path-difference velocity 2v = 0.6329 cm/s (a common setting, used here as a teaching assumption), light at 1000 cm⁻¹ is modulated at f = 0.6329×1000 ≈ 633 Hz, 4000 cm⁻¹ at about 2.5 kHz, and the HeNe reference at 15798 cm⁻¹ near 10 kHz."],"answer":2,"explanation":"取光程差速度 2v = 0.6329 cm/s（常見設定，此處為教學假設），波數 1000 cm⁻¹ 的光被調變在 f = 0.6329×1000 ≈ 633 Hz；4000 cm⁻¹ 在約 2.5 kHz；氦氖參考雷射 15798 cm⁻¹ 則在約 10 kHz。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"With a path-difference velocity 2v = 0.6329 cm/s (a common setting, used here as a teaching assumption), light at 1000 cm⁻¹ is modulated at f = 0.6329×1000 ≈ 633 Hz, 4000 cm⁻¹ at about 2.5 kHz, and the HeNe reference at 15798 cm⁻¹ near 10 kHz; the detector and preamplifier bandwidth must cover this whole audio band or the high-wavenumber end is attenuated. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":2},{"id":"a431-v12-03","title":"干涉圖與光譜的傅立葉對：量測與驗證","titleEn":"The interferogram–spectrum Fourier pair: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"],"prerequisiteIds":["a431-v12-02"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「麥克森干涉儀與干涉圖」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Michelson interferometer and interferogram” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"在儀器診斷模式觀察干涉圖：中心爆（centre burst）的峰值電壓應落在 ADC 量程的 30–70%，單光束光譜在 2000 cm⁻¹ 附近的能量應與出廠基準相符；接著以示波器或診斷軟體檢查氦氖條紋頻率是否約為 10 kHz，確認動鏡速度與調變頻率的對應關係。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"In the instrument diagnostic mode inspect the interferogram: the centre-burst peak should sit at 30–70% of the ADC range, and the single-beam energy near 2000 cm⁻¹ should match the factory baseline; then check with an oscilloscope or the diagnostic software that the HeNe fringe frequency is close to 10 kHz, confirming the mirror velocity and the modulation-frequency mapping. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：若動鏡速度設定高於 DTGS 偵測器的響應頻寬，高波數端訊號會被偵測器的低通特性壓低，單光束光譜在 4000 cm⁻¹ 附近塌陷，使用者誤以為是光源老化。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: If the mirror velocity is set above the DTGS detector's response bandwidth, the detector's low-pass behaviour suppresses the high-wavenumber end, the single-beam spectrum collapses near 4000 cm⁻¹, and users wrongly blame an aging source.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a431-v12-03-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"在儀器診斷模式觀察干涉圖：中心爆（centre burst）的峰值電壓應落在 ADC 量程的 30–70%，單光束光譜在 2000 cm⁻¹ 附近的能量應與出廠基準相符；接著以示波器或診斷軟體檢查氦氖條紋頻率是否約為 10 kHz，確認動鏡速度與調變頻率的對應關係。","textEn":"In the instrument diagnostic mode inspect the interferogram: the centre-burst peak should sit at 30–70% of the ADC range, and the single-beam energy near 2000 cm⁻¹ should match the factory baseline; then check with an oscilloscope or the diagnostic software that the HeNe fringe frequency is close to 10 kHz, confirming the mirror velocity and the modulation-frequency mapping.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"]},{"id":"a431-v12-03-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「干涉圖與光譜的傅立葉對」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"The interferogram–spectrum Fourier pair\"?","options":["在儀器診斷模式觀察干涉圖：中心爆（centre burst）的峰值電壓應落在 ADC 量程的 30–70%，單光束光譜在 2000 cm⁻¹ 附近的能量應與出廠基準相符。","量測時不必記錄溫度、振動與時間等條件，因為它們不會影響結果。","只要樣品與背景在同一天量測，水氣與 CO₂ 就會完全相消。"],"optionsEn":["In the instrument diagnostic mode inspect the interferogram: the centre-burst peak should sit at 30–70% of the ADC range, and the single-beam energy near 2000 cm⁻¹ should match the factory baseline.","Temperature, vibration and timing need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","As long as sample and background are measured on the same day, water vapour and CO₂ cancel completely."],"answer":0,"explanation":"在儀器診斷模式觀察干涉圖：中心爆（centre burst）的峰值電壓應落在 ADC 量程的 30–70%，單光束光譜在 2000 cm⁻¹ 附近的能量應與出廠基準相符；接著以示波器或診斷軟體檢查氦氖條紋頻率是否約為 10 kHz，確認動鏡速度與調變頻率的對應關係。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"In the instrument diagnostic mode inspect the interferogram: the centre-burst peak should sit at 30–70% of the ADC range, and the single-beam energy near 2000 cm⁻¹ should match the factory baseline; then check with an oscilloscope or the diagnostic software that the HeNe fringe frequency is close to 10 kHz, confirming the mirror velocity and the modulation-frequency mapping. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":3},{"id":"a431-v12-04","title":"干涉圖與光譜的傅立葉對：失效診斷","titleEn":"The interferogram–spectrum Fourier pair: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"],"prerequisiteIds":["a431-v12-03"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「麥克森干涉儀與干涉圖」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Michelson interferometer and interferogram” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"若動鏡速度設定高於 DTGS 偵測器的響應頻寬，高波數端訊號會被偵測器的低通特性壓低，單光束光譜在 4000 cm⁻¹ 附近塌陷，使用者誤以為是光源老化。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"If the mirror velocity is set above the DTGS detector's response bandwidth, the detector's low-pass behaviour suppresses the high-wavenumber end, the single-beam spectrum collapses near 4000 cm⁻¹, and users wrongly blame an aging source. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：這就是費爾蓋特多工優勢的來源：整個掃描時間內每個波數都在累積訊號，而不是像色散式儀器逐一通過狹縫。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: This is the Fellgett multiplex advantage: every spectral element accumulates signal for the whole scan rather than taking turns through a slit.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「FTIR 是用某種精密光柵把紅外光分成各個波長後逐一量測。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"An FTIR uses a fine grating to separate the infrared wavelengths and measures them one at a time.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a431-v12-04-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"若動鏡速度設定高於 DTGS 偵測器的響應頻寬，高波數端訊號會被偵測器的低通特性壓低，單光束光譜在 4000 cm⁻¹ 附近塌陷，使用者誤以為是光源老化。","textEn":"If the mirror velocity is set above the DTGS detector's response bandwidth, the detector's low-pass behaviour suppresses the high-wavenumber end, the single-beam spectrum collapses near 4000 cm⁻¹, and users wrongly blame an aging source.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"]},{"id":"a431-v12-04-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「干涉圖與光譜的傅立葉對」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"The interferogram–spectrum Fourier pair\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自操作人員失誤，系統設計不需要檢討。","若動鏡速度設定高於 DTGS 偵測器的響應頻寬，高波數端訊號會被偵測器的低通特性壓低，單光束光譜在 4000 cm⁻¹ 附近塌陷，使用者誤以為是光源老化。","動鏡走得越遠，解析度就無限提高，與光闌大小無關。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is operator error, so the system design never needs review.","If the mirror velocity is set above the DTGS detector's response bandwidth, the detector's low-pass behaviour suppresses the high-wavenumber end, the single-beam spectrum collapses near 4000 cm⁻¹, and users wrongly blame an aging source.","Longer mirror travel keeps improving resolution indefinitely, regardless of aperture size."],"answer":1,"explanation":"若動鏡速度設定高於 DTGS 偵測器的響應頻寬，高波數端訊號會被偵測器的低通特性壓低，單光束光譜在 4000 cm⁻¹ 附近塌陷，使用者誤以為是光源老化。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"If the mirror velocity is set above the DTGS detector's response bandwidth, the detector's low-pass behaviour suppresses the high-wavenumber end, the single-beam spectrum collapses near 4000 cm⁻¹, and users wrongly blame an aging source. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":4},{"id":"a431-v12-05","title":"解析度、切趾與通量優勢：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Resolution, apodization and the throughput advantage: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"],"prerequisiteIds":["a431-v12-04"],"objective":"說明「動鏡行程與雅基諾光闌」如何決定傅立葉轉換紅外光譜儀的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Mirror travel and the Jacquinot stop” determines the key performance of “Fourier-transform infrared spectrometers”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"光譜解析度由最大光程差 Δ_max 決定：Δν̃ ≈ 1/Δ_max，動鏡只需移動 Δ_max/2，因為光程差是鏡位移的兩倍。干涉圖在 Δ_max 處被截斷相當於乘上矩形窗，光譜中每條譜線因此帶有 sinc 形的儀器線形與 −22% 的旁瓣；改用三角形等切趾函數可壓低旁瓣，代價是線寬變寬。雅基諾優勢來自干涉儀不需要狹縫：允許的立體角 Ω = 2π/R（R 為解析能力 ν̃_max/Δν̃），遠大於同解析度的光柵儀器，因此可用較大的光闌通過更多能量。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「動鏡行程與雅基諾光闌」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Spectral resolution is fixed by the maximum optical path difference Δ_max through Δν̃ ≈ 1/Δ_max, and the mirror itself travels only Δ_max/2 because path difference is twice the mirror displacement. Truncating the interferogram at Δ_max multiplies it by a boxcar window, so every spectral line carries a sinc instrument line shape with −22% side lobes; a triangular or similar apodization suppresses the side lobes at the cost of a wider line. The Jacquinot advantage arises because an interferometer needs no slit: the admissible solid angle is Ω = 2π/R with R = ν̃_max/Δν̃ the resolving power, far larger than a grating instrument of equal resolution, so a larger stop passes more energy. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Mirror travel and the Jacquinot stop”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：標稱解析度 4 cm⁻¹ 需要 Δ_max = 0.25 cm，動鏡行程 1.25 mm；矩形窗的線寬 FWHM = 0.603/Δ_max = 2.41 cm⁻¹，三角切趾為 0.886/Δ_max = 3.54 cm⁻¹。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: A nominal 4 cm⁻¹ resolution needs Δ_max = 0.25 cm, i.e. 1.25 mm of mirror travel; the boxcar line width is FWHM = 0.603/Δ_max = 2.41 cm⁻¹ and triangular apodization gives 0.886/Δ_max = 3.54 cm⁻¹.","failure":"常見誤解：「動鏡走得越遠，解析度就無限提高，與光闌大小無關。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Longer mirror travel keeps improving resolution indefinitely, regardless of aperture size.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「動鏡行程與雅基諾光闌」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Mirror travel and the Jacquinot stop”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a431-v12-05-k1","title":"解析度、切趾與通量優勢","titleEn":"Resolution, apodization and the throughput advantage","text":"光譜解析度由最大光程差 Δ_max 決定：Δν̃ ≈ 1/Δ_max，動鏡只需移動 Δ_max/2，因為光程差是鏡位移的兩倍。干涉圖在 Δ_max 處被截斷相當於乘上矩形窗，光譜中每條譜線因此帶有 sinc 形的儀器線形與 −22% 的旁瓣；改用三角形等切趾函數可壓低旁瓣，代價是線寬變寬。","textEn":"Spectral resolution is fixed by the maximum optical path difference Δ_max through Δν̃ ≈ 1/Δ_max, and the mirror itself travels only Δ_max/2 because path difference is twice the mirror displacement. Truncating the interferogram at Δ_max multiplies it by a boxcar window, so every spectral line carries a sinc instrument line shape with −22% side lobes; a triangular or similar apodization suppresses the side lobes at the cost of a wider line.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"]},{"id":"a431-v12-05-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：動鏡走得越遠，解析度就無限提高，與光闌大小無關。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Longer mirror travel keeps improving resolution indefinitely, regardless of aperture size. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「解析度、切趾與通量優勢」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Resolution, apodization and the throughput advantage\" is correct?","options":["動鏡走得越遠，解析度就無限提高，與光闌大小無關。","MCT 偵測器在任何情況下都優於 DTGS，所以應該永遠使用 MCT。","光譜解析度由最大光程差 Δ_max 決定：Δν̃ ≈ 1/Δ_max，動鏡只需移動 Δ_max/2，因為光程差是鏡位移的兩倍。"],"optionsEn":["Longer mirror travel keeps improving resolution indefinitely, regardless of aperture size.","An MCT detector is better than DTGS in every situation, so MCT should always be used.","Spectral resolution is fixed by the maximum optical path difference Δ_max through Δν̃ ≈ 1/Δ_max, and the mirror itself travels only Δ_max/2 because path difference is twice the mirror displacement."],"answer":2,"explanation":"光譜解析度由最大光程差 Δ_max 決定：Δν̃ ≈ 1/Δ_max，動鏡只需移動 Δ_max/2，因為光程差是鏡位移的兩倍。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Spectral resolution is fixed by the maximum optical path difference Δ_max through Δν̃ ≈ 1/Δ_max, and the mirror itself travels only Δ_max/2 because path difference is twice the mirror displacement. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":5},{"id":"a431-v12-06","title":"解析度、切趾與通量優勢：定量估算","titleEn":"Resolution, apodization and the throughput advantage: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"],"prerequisiteIds":["a431-v12-05"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「動鏡行程與雅基諾光闌」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Mirror travel and the Jacquinot stop” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：標稱解析度 4 cm⁻¹ 需要 Δ_max = 0.25 cm，動鏡行程 1.25 mm；矩形窗的線寬 FWHM = 0.603/Δ_max = 2.41 cm⁻¹，三角切趾為 0.886/Δ_max = 3.54 cm⁻¹。雅基諾光闌：R = 4000/4 = 1000，Ω = 2π/1000 = 6.28×10⁻³ sr，半角 θ = √(Ω/π) = 0.0447 rad（2.56°）；若準直鏡焦距 100 mm，光闌直徑 = 2fθ ≈ 8.9 mm。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: A nominal 4 cm⁻¹ resolution needs Δ_max = 0.25 cm, i.e. 1.25 mm of mirror travel; the boxcar line width is FWHM = 0.603/Δ_max = 2.41 cm⁻¹ and triangular apodization gives 0.886/Δ_max = 3.54 cm⁻¹. For the Jacquinot stop, R = 4000/4 = 1000, Ω = 2π/1000 = 6.28×10⁻³ sr, half-angle θ = √(Ω/π) = 0.0447 rad (2.56°); with a 100 mm collimator focal length the stop diameter is 2fθ ≈ 8.9 mm. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：量測低壓氣體（如 CO 或 HCl）的窄轉動譜線或聚苯乙烯 2851/2870 cm⁻¹ 這一對譜線：比較矩形窗與三角切趾下的線寬與旁瓣，確認 FWHM 符合 0.603/Δ_max 與 0.886/Δ_max 的預測；再逐級縮小光闌，觀察單光束能量按光闌面積下降而線寬不再改善。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Measure narrow rotational lines of a low-pressure gas such as CO or HCl, or the polystyrene 2851/2870 cm⁻¹ pair, and compare line width and side lobes under boxcar and triangular apodization against the 0.603/Δ_max and 0.886/Δ_max predictions; then close the aperture step by step and confirm that single-beam energy falls with stop area while the line width stops improving.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a431-v12-06-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"標稱解析度 4 cm⁻¹ 需要 Δ_max = 0.25 cm，動鏡行程 1.25 mm；矩形窗的線寬 FWHM = 0.603/Δ_max = 2.41 cm⁻¹，三角切趾為 0.886/Δ_max = 3.54 cm⁻¹。雅基諾光闌：R = 4000/4 = 1000，Ω = 2π/1000 = 6.28×10⁻³ sr，半角 θ = √(Ω/π) = 0.0447 rad（2.56°）；若準直鏡焦距 100 mm，光闌直徑 = 2fθ ≈ 8.9 mm。","textEn":"A nominal 4 cm⁻¹ resolution needs Δ_max = 0.25 cm, i.e. 1.25 mm of mirror travel; the boxcar line width is FWHM = 0.603/Δ_max = 2.41 cm⁻¹ and triangular apodization gives 0.886/Δ_max = 3.54 cm⁻¹. For the Jacquinot stop, R = 4000/4 = 1000, Ω = 2π/1000 = 6.28×10⁻³ sr, half-angle θ = √(Ω/π) = 0.0447 rad (2.56°); with a 100 mm collimator focal length the stop diameter is 2fθ ≈ 8.9 mm.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"]},{"id":"a431-v12-06-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「解析度、切趾與通量優勢」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Resolution, apodization and the throughput advantage\", which statement holds?","options":["標稱解析度 4 cm⁻¹ 需要 Δ_max = 0.25 cm，動鏡行程 1.25 mm。","因為有氦氖雷射，FTIR 的波數軸永遠不需要校正。","只要樣品與背景在同一天量測，水氣與 CO₂ 就會完全相消。"],"optionsEn":["A nominal 4 cm⁻¹ resolution needs Δ_max = 0.25 cm, i.e. 1.25 mm of mirror travel.","Because of the HeNe laser, an FTIR wavenumber axis never needs calibration.","As long as sample and background are measured on the same day, water vapour and CO₂ cancel completely."],"answer":0,"explanation":"標稱解析度 4 cm⁻¹ 需要 Δ_max = 0.25 cm，動鏡行程 1.25 mm；矩形窗的線寬 FWHM = 0.603/Δ_max = 2.41 cm⁻¹，三角切趾為 0.886/Δ_max = 3.54 cm⁻¹。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"A nominal 4 cm⁻¹ resolution needs Δ_max = 0.25 cm, i.e. 1.25 mm of mirror travel; the boxcar line width is FWHM = 0.603/Δ_max = 2.41 cm⁻¹ and triangular apodization gives 0.886/Δ_max = 3.54 cm⁻¹. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":6},{"id":"a431-v12-07","title":"解析度、切趾與通量優勢：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Resolution, apodization and the throughput advantage: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"],"prerequisiteIds":["a431-v12-06"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「動鏡行程與雅基諾光闌」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Mirror travel and the Jacquinot stop” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"量測低壓氣體（如 CO 或 HCl）的窄轉動譜線或聚苯乙烯 2851/2870 cm⁻¹ 這一對譜線：比較矩形窗與三角切趾下的線寬與旁瓣，確認 FWHM 符合 0.603/Δ_max 與 0.886/Δ_max 的預測；再逐級縮小光闌，觀察單光束能量按光闌面積下降而線寬不再改善。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Measure narrow rotational lines of a low-pressure gas such as CO or HCl, or the polystyrene 2851/2870 cm⁻¹ pair, and compare line width and side lobes under boxcar and triangular apodization against the 0.603/Δ_max and 0.886/Δ_max predictions; then close the aperture step by step and confirm that single-beam energy falls with stop area while the line width stops improving. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：為了追求 0.5 cm⁻¹ 解析度卻沒有縮小光闌，離軸光線的光程差縮短使譜線變寬、峰位偏移，解析度實際達不到標稱值；反之光闌太小又讓訊雜比下降到無法使用。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Chasing 0.5 cm⁻¹ resolution without closing the aperture lets off-axis rays with shortened path difference broaden and shift the lines so the nominal resolution is never reached; closing the stop too far instead drives the signal-to-noise ratio below usability.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a431-v12-07-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"量測低壓氣體（如 CO 或 HCl）的窄轉動譜線或聚苯乙烯 2851/2870 cm⁻¹ 這一對譜線：比較矩形窗與三角切趾下的線寬與旁瓣，確認 FWHM 符合 0.603/Δ_max 與 0.886/Δ_max 的預測；再逐級縮小光闌，觀察單光束能量按光闌面積下降而線寬不再改善。","textEn":"Measure narrow rotational lines of a low-pressure gas such as CO or HCl, or the polystyrene 2851/2870 cm⁻¹ pair, and compare line width and side lobes under boxcar and triangular apodization against the 0.603/Δ_max and 0.886/Δ_max predictions; then close the aperture step by step and confirm that single-beam energy falls with stop area while the line width stops improving.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"]},{"id":"a431-v12-07-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「解析度、切趾與通量優勢」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Resolution, apodization and the throughput advantage\"?","options":["沿用另一台設備或另一個案例的量測結果，就可視為本系統已完成驗證。","量測低壓氣體（如 CO 或 HCl）的窄轉動譜線或聚苯乙烯 2851/2870 cm⁻¹ 這一對譜線：比較矩形窗與三角切趾下的線寬與旁瓣，確認 FWHM 符合 0.603/Δ_max 與 0.886/Δ_max 的預測。","儀器自我診斷顯示綠燈，就等於通過性能驗證。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another instrument or another case counts as verifying this system.","Measure narrow rotational lines of a low-pressure gas such as CO or HCl, or the polystyrene 2851/2870 cm⁻¹ pair, and compare line width and side lobes under boxcar and triangular apodization against the 0.603/Δ_max and 0.886/Δ_max predictions.","A green self-diagnostic light is the same as passing performance qualification."],"answer":1,"explanation":"量測低壓氣體（如 CO 或 HCl）的窄轉動譜線或聚苯乙烯 2851/2870 cm⁻¹ 這一對譜線：比較矩形窗與三角切趾下的線寬與旁瓣，確認 FWHM 符合 0.603/Δ_max 與 0.886/Δ_max 的預測；再逐級縮小光闌，觀察單光束能量按光闌面積下降而線寬不再改善。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Measure narrow rotational lines of a low-pressure gas such as CO or HCl, or the polystyrene 2851/2870 cm⁻¹ pair, and compare line width and side lobes under boxcar and triangular apodization against the 0.603/Δ_max and 0.886/Δ_max predictions; then close the aperture step by step and confirm that single-beam energy falls with stop area while the line width stops improving. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":7},{"id":"a431-v12-08","title":"解析度、切趾與通量優勢：失效診斷","titleEn":"Resolution, apodization and the throughput advantage: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"],"prerequisiteIds":["a431-v12-07"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「動鏡行程與雅基諾光闌」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Mirror travel and the Jacquinot stop” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"為了追求 0.5 cm⁻¹ 解析度卻沒有縮小光闌，離軸光線的光程差縮短使譜線變寬、峰位偏移，解析度實際達不到標稱值；反之光闌太小又讓訊雜比下降到無法使用。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Chasing 0.5 cm⁻¹ resolution without closing the aperture lets off-axis rays with shortened path difference broaden and shift the lines so the nominal resolution is never reached; closing the stop too far instead drives the signal-to-noise ratio below usability. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：雅基諾優勢來自干涉儀不需要狹縫：允許的立體角 Ω = 2π/R（R 為解析能力 ν̃_max/Δν̃），遠大於同解析度的光柵儀器，因此可用較大的光闌通過更多能量。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The Jacquinot advantage arises because an interferometer needs no slit: the admissible solid angle is Ω = 2π/R with R = ν̃_max/Δν̃ the resolving power, far larger than a grating instrument of equal resolution, so a larger stop passes more energy.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「動鏡走得越遠，解析度就無限提高，與光闌大小無關。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Longer mirror travel keeps improving resolution indefinitely, regardless of aperture size.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a431-v12-08-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"為了追求 0.5 cm⁻¹ 解析度卻沒有縮小光闌，離軸光線的光程差縮短使譜線變寬、峰位偏移，解析度實際達不到標稱值；反之光闌太小又讓訊雜比下降到無法使用。","textEn":"Chasing 0.5 cm⁻¹ resolution without closing the aperture lets off-axis rays with shortened path difference broaden and shift the lines so the nominal resolution is never reached; closing the stop too far instead drives the signal-to-noise ratio below usability.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"]},{"id":"a431-v12-08-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「解析度、切趾與通量優勢」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Resolution, apodization and the throughput advantage\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["調高增益或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數異常。","MCT 偵測器在任何情況下都優於 DTGS，所以應該永遠使用 MCT。","為了追求 0.5 cm⁻¹ 解析度卻沒有縮小光闌，離軸光線的光程差縮短使譜線變寬、峰位偏移，解析度實際達不到標稱值；反之光闌太小又讓訊雜比下降到無法使用。"],"optionsEn":["Raising the gain or widening the acceptance limits solves most anomalies.","An MCT detector is better than DTGS in every situation, so MCT should always be used.","Chasing 0.5 cm⁻¹ resolution without closing the aperture lets off-axis rays with shortened path difference broaden and shift the lines so the nominal resolution is never reached."],"answer":2,"explanation":"為了追求 0.5 cm⁻¹ 解析度卻沒有縮小光闌，離軸光線的光程差縮短使譜線變寬、峰位偏移，解析度實際達不到標稱值；反之光闌太小又讓訊雜比下降到無法使用。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Chasing 0.5 cm⁻¹ resolution without closing the aperture lets off-axis rays with shortened path difference broaden and shift the lines so the nominal resolution is never reached; closing the stop too far instead drives the signal-to-noise ratio below usability. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":8}],"order":1},{"id":"a431-v12-s2","title":"元件、材料與製造","titleEn":"Components, materials and fabrication","description":"本階段聚焦「光源、分光鏡與偵測器選擇」與「動鏡掃描機構與氦氖取樣」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Source, beamsplitter and detector selection\" and \"Scanner mechanics and HeNe fringe sampling\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a431-v12-09","title":"光源、分光鏡與偵測器選擇：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Source, beamsplitter and detector selection: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"],"prerequisiteIds":["a431-v12-08"],"objective":"說明「KBr/Ge 分光鏡與 DTGS/MCT 偵測器」如何決定傅立葉轉換紅外光譜儀的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “KBr/Ge beamsplitter and DTGS/MCT detectors” determines the key performance of “Fourier-transform infrared spectrometers”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"中紅外光源通常是加熱到約 1300 K 的碳化矽棒（globar），依普朗克定律其峰值在 2.2 µm 附近，10 µm 處只在長波尾端。分光鏡是鍍 Ge 的 KBr 基板，覆蓋約 7800–350 cm⁻¹，但 KBr 會潮解，必須保持乾燥；遠紅外改用 Mylar 或固態分光鏡，近紅外改用 CaF₂ 或石英。偵測器有兩類：室溫的 DTGS 熱電型偵測器響應平坦但靈敏度低且隨調變頻率滾降；液態氮冷卻的 MCT 光導偵測器靈敏度高一到兩個數量級，但截止在約 600–750 cm⁻¹，且在強光下非線性。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「KBr/Ge 分光鏡與 DTGS/MCT 偵測器」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"The mid-infrared source is usually a silicon-carbide rod (globar) heated to about 1300 K; by Planck's law its emission peaks near 2.2 µm, so 10 µm lies on the long-wavelength tail. The beamsplitter is a germanium-coated KBr substrate covering roughly 7800–350 cm⁻¹, but KBr is hygroscopic and must be kept dry; far-infrared work uses Mylar or solid-state beamsplitters and near-infrared uses CaF₂ or quartz. Two detector classes exist: the room-temperature pyroelectric DTGS has a flat response but low sensitivity that rolls off with modulation frequency, while liquid-nitrogen-cooled photoconductive MCT is one to two orders more sensitive but cuts off near 600–750 cm⁻¹ and becomes nonlinear under strong illumination. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “KBr/Ge beamsplitter and DTGS/MCT detectors”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：偵測器的雜訊等效功率為 NEP = √(A_d·Δf)/D*。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Noise-equivalent power is NEP = √(A_d·Δf)/D*.","failure":"常見誤解：「MCT 偵測器在任何情況下都優於 DTGS，所以應該永遠使用 MCT。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"An MCT detector is better than DTGS in every situation, so MCT should always be used.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「KBr/Ge 分光鏡與 DTGS/MCT 偵測器」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “KBr/Ge beamsplitter and DTGS/MCT detectors”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a431-v12-09-k1","title":"光源、分光鏡與偵測器選擇","titleEn":"Source, beamsplitter and detector selection","text":"中紅外光源通常是加熱到約 1300 K 的碳化矽棒（globar），依普朗克定律其峰值在 2.2 µm 附近，10 µm 處只在長波尾端。分光鏡是鍍 Ge 的 KBr 基板，覆蓋約 7800–350 cm⁻¹，但 KBr 會潮解，必須保持乾燥；遠紅外改用 Mylar 或固態分光鏡，近紅外改用 CaF₂ 或石英。","textEn":"The mid-infrared source is usually a silicon-carbide rod (globar) heated to about 1300 K; by Planck's law its emission peaks near 2.2 µm, so 10 µm lies on the long-wavelength tail. The beamsplitter is a germanium-coated KBr substrate covering roughly 7800–350 cm⁻¹, but KBr is hygroscopic and must be kept dry; far-infrared work uses Mylar or solid-state beamsplitters and near-infrared uses CaF₂ or quartz.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"]},{"id":"a431-v12-09-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：MCT 偵測器在任何情況下都優於 DTGS，所以應該永遠使用 MCT。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: An MCT detector is better than DTGS in every situation, so MCT should always be used. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「光源、分光鏡與偵測器選擇」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Source, beamsplitter and detector selection\" is correct?","options":["中紅外光源通常是加熱到約 1300 K 的碳化矽棒（globar），依普朗克定律其峰值在 2.2 µm 附近，10 µm 處只在長波尾端。","MCT 偵測器在任何情況下都優於 DTGS，所以應該永遠使用 MCT。","氦氖雷射只是幫動鏡對準用的，對波數準確度沒有影響。"],"optionsEn":["The mid-infrared source is usually a silicon-carbide rod (globar) heated to about 1300 K.","An MCT detector is better than DTGS in every situation, so MCT should always be used.","The HeNe laser only helps align the moving mirror and has no effect on wavenumber accuracy."],"answer":0,"explanation":"中紅外光源通常是加熱到約 1300 K 的碳化矽棒（globar），依普朗克定律其峰值在 2.2 µm 附近，10 µm 處只在長波尾端。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"The mid-infrared source is usually a silicon-carbide rod (globar) heated to about 1300 K; by Planck's law its emission peaks near 2.2 µm, so 10 µm lies on the long-wavelength tail. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":9},{"id":"a431-v12-10","title":"光源、分光鏡與偵測器選擇：定量估算","titleEn":"Source, beamsplitter and detector selection: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"],"prerequisiteIds":["a431-v12-09"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「KBr/Ge 分光鏡與 DTGS/MCT 偵測器」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “KBr/Ge beamsplitter and DTGS/MCT detectors” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：偵測器的雜訊等效功率為 NEP = √(A_d·Δf)/D*。DTGS 取 D* = 2×10⁸ cm·Hz^½/W、感光面積 2 mm×2 mm（√A = 0.2 cm）、頻寬 Δf = 1 Hz，NEP = 0.2/2×10⁸ = 1×10⁻⁹ W；MCT 取 D* = 2×10¹⁰、面積 1 mm×1 mm（√A = 0.1 cm），NEP = 0.1/2×10¹⁰ = 5×10⁻¹² W，靈敏度約好 200 倍。光源依維恩位移定律：λ_max = 2898 µm·K/1300 K = 2.23 µm，即約 4490 cm⁻¹。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Noise-equivalent power is NEP = √(A_d·Δf)/D*. For DTGS with D* = 2×10⁸ cm·Hz^½/W, a 2 mm × 2 mm element (√A = 0.2 cm) and Δf = 1 Hz, NEP = 0.2/2×10⁸ = 1×10⁻⁹ W; for MCT with D* = 2×10¹⁰ and a 1 mm × 1 mm element (√A = 0.1 cm), NEP = 0.1/2×10¹⁰ = 5×10⁻¹² W, roughly 200 times better. Wien's law gives λ_max = 2898 µm·K/1300 K = 2.23 µm, about 4490 cm⁻¹. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：以空光路單光束光譜檢查分光鏡的有效範圍與 KBr 吸水徵兆（低波數端能量下降、基線起伏）；比較 DTGS 與 MCT 在同一取樣條件下的 100% 線雜訊，確認 MCT 的增益約為兩個數量級，並用衰減片檢查 MCT 在中心爆峰值下是否出現非線性造成的負吸收。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Use an empty-beam single-beam spectrum to check the beamsplitter's usable range and signs of KBr moisture uptake (energy loss at low wavenumbers, baseline undulation); compare the 100% line noise of DTGS and MCT under identical conditions to confirm the two-order gain, and insert attenuators to check whether the MCT shows nonlinearity-induced negative absorbance below the centre-burst peak.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a431-v12-10-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"偵測器的雜訊等效功率為 NEP = √(A_d·Δf)/D*。DTGS 取 D* = 2×10⁸ cm·Hz^½/W、感光面積 2 mm×2 mm（√A = 0.2 cm）、頻寬 Δf = 1 Hz，NEP = 0.2/2×10⁸ = 1×10⁻⁹ W；MCT 取 D* = 2×10¹⁰、面積 1 mm×1 mm（√A = 0.1 cm），NEP = 0.1/2×10¹⁰ = 5×10⁻¹² W，靈敏度約好 200 倍。光源依維恩位移定律：λ_max = 2898 µm·K/1300 K = 2.23 µm，即約 4490 cm⁻¹。","textEn":"Noise-equivalent power is NEP = √(A_d·Δf)/D*. For DTGS with D* = 2×10⁸ cm·Hz^½/W, a 2 mm × 2 mm element (√A = 0.2 cm) and Δf = 1 Hz, NEP = 0.2/2×10⁸ = 1×10⁻⁹ W; for MCT with D* = 2×10¹⁰ and a 1 mm × 1 mm element (√A = 0.1 cm), NEP = 0.1/2×10¹⁰ = 5×10⁻¹² W, roughly 200 times better. Wien's law gives λ_max = 2898 µm·K/1300 K = 2.23 µm, about 4490 cm⁻¹.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"]},{"id":"a431-v12-10-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「光源、分光鏡與偵測器選擇」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Source, beamsplitter and detector selection\", which statement holds?","options":["解析度越高光譜越好，掃描次數只是為了美觀。","偵測器的雜訊等效功率為 NEP = √(A_d·Δf)/D*。","儀器自我診斷顯示綠燈，就等於通過性能驗證。"],"optionsEn":["Higher resolution always gives a better spectrum, and scan averaging is merely cosmetic.","Noise-equivalent power is NEP = √(A_d·Δf)/D*.","A green self-diagnostic light is the same as passing performance qualification."],"answer":1,"explanation":"偵測器的雜訊等效功率為 NEP = √(A_d·Δf)/D*。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Noise-equivalent power is NEP = √(A_d·Δf)/D*. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":10},{"id":"a431-v12-11","title":"光源、分光鏡與偵測器選擇：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Source, beamsplitter and detector selection: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"],"prerequisiteIds":["a431-v12-10"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「KBr/Ge 分光鏡與 DTGS/MCT 偵測器」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “KBr/Ge beamsplitter and DTGS/MCT detectors” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"以空光路單光束光譜檢查分光鏡的有效範圍與 KBr 吸水徵兆（低波數端能量下降、基線起伏）；比較 DTGS 與 MCT 在同一取樣條件下的 100% 線雜訊，確認 MCT 的增益約為兩個數量級，並用衰減片檢查 MCT 在中心爆峰值下是否出現非線性造成的負吸收。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Use an empty-beam single-beam spectrum to check the beamsplitter's usable range and signs of KBr moisture uptake (energy loss at low wavenumbers, baseline undulation); compare the 100% line noise of DTGS and MCT under identical conditions to confirm the two-order gain, and insert attenuators to check whether the MCT shows nonlinearity-induced negative absorbance below the centre-burst peak. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：乾燥劑失效後 KBr 分光鏡表面霧化，600 cm⁻¹ 以下的能量先消失、接著整個光譜基線扭曲；更換分光鏡與重新乾燥比例行維護貴得多。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: After the desiccant is exhausted the KBr beamsplitter fogs, energy below 600 cm⁻¹ disappears first and then the whole baseline distorts; replacing the beamsplitter and re-drying costs far more than routine maintenance.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a431-v12-11-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以空光路單光束光譜檢查分光鏡的有效範圍與 KBr 吸水徵兆（低波數端能量下降、基線起伏）；比較 DTGS 與 MCT 在同一取樣條件下的 100% 線雜訊，確認 MCT 的增益約為兩個數量級，並用衰減片檢查 MCT 在中心爆峰值下是否出現非線性造成的負吸收。","textEn":"Use an empty-beam single-beam spectrum to check the beamsplitter's usable range and signs of KBr moisture uptake (energy loss at low wavenumbers, baseline undulation); compare the 100% line noise of DTGS and MCT under identical conditions to confirm the two-order gain, and insert attenuators to check whether the MCT shows nonlinearity-induced negative absorbance below the centre-burst peak.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"]},{"id":"a431-v12-11-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「光源、分光鏡與偵測器選擇」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Source, beamsplitter and detector selection\"?","options":["只看單次讀值或外觀即可判定合格，不需要基準件或重複量測。","FTIR 是用某種精密光柵把紅外光分成各個波長後逐一量測。","以空光路單光束光譜檢查分光鏡的有效範圍與 KBr 吸水徵兆（低波數端能量下降、基線起伏）。"],"optionsEn":["A single reading or a visual impression is enough to accept the result; no reference artefact or repeat measurement is needed.","An FTIR uses a fine grating to separate the infrared wavelengths and measures them one at a time.","Use an empty-beam single-beam spectrum to check the beamsplitter's usable range and signs of KBr moisture uptake (energy loss at low wavenumbers, baseline undulation)."],"answer":2,"explanation":"以空光路單光束光譜檢查分光鏡的有效範圍與 KBr 吸水徵兆（低波數端能量下降、基線起伏）；比較 DTGS 與 MCT 在同一取樣條件下的 100% 線雜訊，確認 MCT 的增益約為兩個數量級，並用衰減片檢查 MCT 在中心爆峰值下是否出現非線性造成的負吸收。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Use an empty-beam single-beam spectrum to check the beamsplitter's usable range and signs of KBr moisture uptake (energy loss at low wavenumbers, baseline undulation); compare the 100% line noise of DTGS and MCT under identical conditions to confirm the two-order gain, and insert attenuators to check whether the MCT shows nonlinearity-induced negative absorbance below the centre-burst peak. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":11},{"id":"a431-v12-12","title":"光源、分光鏡與偵測器選擇：失效診斷","titleEn":"Source, beamsplitter and detector selection: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"],"prerequisiteIds":["a431-v12-11"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「KBr/Ge 分光鏡與 DTGS/MCT 偵測器」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “KBr/Ge beamsplitter and DTGS/MCT detectors” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"乾燥劑失效後 KBr 分光鏡表面霧化，600 cm⁻¹ 以下的能量先消失、接著整個光譜基線扭曲；更換分光鏡與重新乾燥比例行維護貴得多。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"After the desiccant is exhausted the KBr beamsplitter fogs, energy below 600 cm⁻¹ disappears first and then the whole baseline distorts; replacing the beamsplitter and re-drying costs far more than routine maintenance. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：偵測器有兩類：室溫的 DTGS 熱電型偵測器響應平坦但靈敏度低且隨調變頻率滾降；液態氮冷卻的 MCT 光導偵測器靈敏度高一到兩個數量級，但截止在約 600–750 cm⁻¹，且在強光下非線性。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Two detector classes exist: the room-temperature pyroelectric DTGS has a flat response but low sensitivity that rolls off with modulation frequency, while liquid-nitrogen-cooled photoconductive MCT is one to two orders more sensitive but cuts off near 600–750 cm⁻¹ and becomes nonlinear under strong illumination.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「MCT 偵測器在任何情況下都優於 DTGS，所以應該永遠使用 MCT。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"An MCT detector is better than DTGS in every situation, so MCT should always be used.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a431-v12-12-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"乾燥劑失效後 KBr 分光鏡表面霧化，600 cm⁻¹ 以下的能量先消失、接著整個光譜基線扭曲；更換分光鏡與重新乾燥比例行維護貴得多。","textEn":"After the desiccant is exhausted the KBr beamsplitter fogs, energy below 600 cm⁻¹ disappears first and then the whole baseline distorts; replacing the beamsplitter and re-drying costs far more than routine maintenance.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"]},{"id":"a431-v12-12-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「光源、分光鏡與偵測器選擇」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Source, beamsplitter and detector selection\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["乾燥劑失效後 KBr 分光鏡表面霧化，600 cm⁻¹ 以下的能量先消失、接著整個光譜基線扭曲；更換分光鏡與重新乾燥比例行維護貴得多。","異常只出現一次就可以忽略，不需要記錄或追蹤。","氦氖雷射只是幫動鏡對準用的，對波數準確度沒有影響。"],"optionsEn":["After the desiccant is exhausted the KBr beamsplitter fogs, energy below 600 cm⁻¹ disappears first and then the whole baseline distorts.","An anomaly that appears only once can be ignored without logging or follow-up.","The HeNe laser only helps align the moving mirror and has no effect on wavenumber accuracy."],"answer":0,"explanation":"乾燥劑失效後 KBr 分光鏡表面霧化，600 cm⁻¹ 以下的能量先消失、接著整個光譜基線扭曲；更換分光鏡與重新乾燥比例行維護貴得多。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"After the desiccant is exhausted the KBr beamsplitter fogs, energy below 600 cm⁻¹ disappears first and then the whole baseline distorts; replacing the beamsplitter and re-drying costs far more than routine maintenance. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":12},{"id":"a431-v12-13","title":"動鏡掃描機構與氦氖取樣：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Scanner mechanics and HeNe fringe sampling: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"],"prerequisiteIds":["a431-v12-12"],"objective":"說明「氦氖雷射條紋與零交越取樣」如何決定傅立葉轉換紅外光譜儀的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “HeNe fringes and zero-crossing sampling” determines the key performance of “Fourier-transform infrared spectrometers”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"動鏡裝在空氣軸承、撓性或音圈驅動的滑軌上，以伺服控制等速掃描；但真正決定波數軸的不是機械，而是與紅外光共用光路的氦氖參考雷射。氦氖光的干涉條紋每 632.8 nm 光程差重複一次，電子電路在條紋的零交越點觸發 ADC 取樣，因此干涉圖的取樣位置由雷射波長精確定義，這就是康尼斯優勢。取樣間隔決定可達的最高波數（奈奎斯特），每個零交越或每隔幾個零交越取樣是依光譜範圍選擇的設定。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「氦氖雷射條紋與零交越取樣」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"The moving mirror rides on an air bearing, flexure or voice-coil slide under servo control at constant velocity, but the wavenumber axis is defined not by the mechanics but by a HeNe reference laser sharing the optical path. Its fringes repeat every 632.8 nm of path difference and the electronics trigger ADC samples at the fringe zero crossings, so the sample positions are fixed by the laser wavelength; this is the Connes advantage. The sampling interval sets the highest reachable wavenumber (Nyquist), and sampling at every zero crossing or every few crossings is chosen according to the spectral range. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “HeNe fringes and zero-crossing sampling”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：每個零交越取樣一次時 Δx = λ_HeNe/2 = 316.4 nm，奈奎斯特波數 ν̃_max = 1/(2Δx) = 15798 cm⁻¹；每隔一個零交越（Δx = 632.8 nm）為 7899 cm⁻¹，仍涵蓋 KBr 的 7800 cm⁻¹ 上限；每隔三個（Δx = 1.2656 µm）只剩 3950 cm⁻¹，4000 cm⁻¹ 附近的 O–H 伸縮會混疊。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Sampling at every zero crossing gives Δx = λ_HeNe/2 = 316.4 nm and a Nyquist wavenumber ν̃_max = 1/(2Δx) = 15798 cm⁻¹; every second crossing (Δx = 632.8 nm) gives 7899 cm⁻¹, still covering the 7800 cm⁻¹ KBr limit; every fourth (Δx = 1.2656 µm) leaves only 3950 cm⁻¹ and O–H stretches near 4000 cm⁻¹ alias.","failure":"常見誤解：「氦氖雷射只是幫動鏡對準用的，對波數準確度沒有影響。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"The HeNe laser only helps align the moving mirror and has no effect on wavenumber accuracy.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「氦氖雷射條紋與零交越取樣」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “HeNe fringes and zero-crossing sampling”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a431-v12-13-k1","title":"動鏡掃描機構與氦氖取樣","titleEn":"Scanner mechanics and HeNe fringe sampling","text":"動鏡裝在空氣軸承、撓性或音圈驅動的滑軌上，以伺服控制等速掃描；但真正決定波數軸的不是機械，而是與紅外光共用光路的氦氖參考雷射。氦氖光的干涉條紋每 632.8 nm 光程差重複一次，電子電路在條紋的零交越點觸發 ADC 取樣，因此干涉圖的取樣位置由雷射波長精確定義，這就是康尼斯優勢。","textEn":"The moving mirror rides on an air bearing, flexure or voice-coil slide under servo control at constant velocity, but the wavenumber axis is defined not by the mechanics but by a HeNe reference laser sharing the optical path. Its fringes repeat every 632.8 nm of path difference and the electronics trigger ADC samples at the fringe zero crossings, so the sample positions are fixed by the laser wavelength; this is the Connes advantage.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"]},{"id":"a431-v12-13-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：氦氖雷射只是幫動鏡對準用的，對波數準確度沒有影響。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: The HeNe laser only helps align the moving mirror and has no effect on wavenumber accuracy. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「動鏡掃描機構與氦氖取樣」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Scanner mechanics and HeNe fringe sampling\" is correct?","options":["氦氖雷射只是幫動鏡對準用的，對波數準確度沒有影響。","動鏡裝在空氣軸承、撓性或音圈驅動的滑軌上，以伺服控制等速掃描；但真正決定波數軸的不是機械，而是與紅外光共用光路的氦氖參考雷射。","因為有氦氖雷射，FTIR 的波數軸永遠不需要校正。"],"optionsEn":["The HeNe laser only helps align the moving mirror and has no effect on wavenumber accuracy.","The moving mirror rides on an air bearing, flexure or voice-coil slide under servo control at constant velocity, but the wavenumber axis is defined not by the mechanics but by a HeNe reference laser sharing the optical path.","Because of the HeNe laser, an FTIR wavenumber axis never needs calibration."],"answer":1,"explanation":"動鏡裝在空氣軸承、撓性或音圈驅動的滑軌上，以伺服控制等速掃描；但真正決定波數軸的不是機械，而是與紅外光共用光路的氦氖參考雷射。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"The moving mirror rides on an air bearing, flexure or voice-coil slide under servo control at constant velocity, but the wavenumber axis is defined not by the mechanics but by a HeNe reference laser sharing the optical path. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":13},{"id":"a431-v12-14","title":"動鏡掃描機構與氦氖取樣：定量估算","titleEn":"Scanner mechanics and HeNe fringe sampling: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"],"prerequisiteIds":["a431-v12-13"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「氦氖雷射條紋與零交越取樣」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “HeNe fringes and zero-crossing sampling” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：每個零交越取樣一次時 Δx = λ_HeNe/2 = 316.4 nm，奈奎斯特波數 ν̃_max = 1/(2Δx) = 15798 cm⁻¹；每隔一個零交越（Δx = 632.8 nm）為 7899 cm⁻¹，仍涵蓋 KBr 的 7800 cm⁻¹ 上限；每隔三個（Δx = 1.2656 µm）只剩 3950 cm⁻¹，4000 cm⁻¹ 附近的 O–H 伸縮會混疊。4 cm⁻¹（Δ_max = 0.25 cm）、Δx = 632.8 nm 時單邊點數 N = 0.25/632.8×10⁻⁷ ≈ 3950。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Sampling at every zero crossing gives Δx = λ_HeNe/2 = 316.4 nm and a Nyquist wavenumber ν̃_max = 1/(2Δx) = 15798 cm⁻¹; every second crossing (Δx = 632.8 nm) gives 7899 cm⁻¹, still covering the 7800 cm⁻¹ KBr limit; every fourth (Δx = 1.2656 µm) leaves only 3950 cm⁻¹ and O–H stretches near 4000 cm⁻¹ alias. At 4 cm⁻¹ (Δ_max = 0.25 cm) with Δx = 632.8 nm the single-sided point count is N = 0.25/632.8×10⁻⁷ ≈ 3950. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：用示波器同時觀察氦氖正弦條紋與 ADC 觸發脈衝，確認觸發落在零交越且無漏拍；比較不同取樣倍率下的單光束光譜，確認截止波數與 1/(2Δx) 一致；最後刻意改變動鏡速度，確認波數軸不隨速度改變，只有強度頻響改變。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Watch the HeNe sine fringe and the ADC trigger pulses together on an oscilloscope to confirm triggering at the zero crossings with no missed beats; compare single-beam spectra at different sampling ratios to confirm the cutoff equals 1/(2Δx); finally change the mirror velocity deliberately and confirm that the wavenumber axis is unchanged while only the amplitude frequency response shifts.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a431-v12-14-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"每個零交越取樣一次時 Δx = λ_HeNe/2 = 316.4 nm，奈奎斯特波數 ν̃_max = 1/(2Δx) = 15798 cm⁻¹；每隔一個零交越（Δx = 632.8 nm）為 7899 cm⁻¹，仍涵蓋 KBr 的 7800 cm⁻¹ 上限；每隔三個（Δx = 1.2656 µm）只剩 3950 cm⁻¹，4000 cm⁻¹ 附近的 O–H 伸縮會混疊。4 cm⁻¹（Δ_max = 0.25 cm）、Δx = 632.8 nm 時單邊點數 N = 0.25/632.8×10⁻⁷ ≈ 3950。","textEn":"Sampling at every zero crossing gives Δx = λ_HeNe/2 = 316.4 nm and a Nyquist wavenumber ν̃_max = 1/(2Δx) = 15798 cm⁻¹; every second crossing (Δx = 632.8 nm) gives 7899 cm⁻¹, still covering the 7800 cm⁻¹ KBr limit; every fourth (Δx = 1.2656 µm) leaves only 3950 cm⁻¹ and O–H stretches near 4000 cm⁻¹ alias. At 4 cm⁻¹ (Δ_max = 0.25 cm) with Δx = 632.8 nm the single-sided point count is N = 0.25/632.8×10⁻⁷ ≈ 3950.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"]},{"id":"a431-v12-14-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「動鏡掃描機構與氦氖取樣」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Scanner mechanics and HeNe fringe sampling\", which statement holds?","options":["只要樣品與背景在同一天量測，水氣與 CO₂ 就會完全相消。","FTIR 是用某種精密光柵把紅外光分成各個波長後逐一量測。","每個零交越取樣一次時 Δx = λ_HeNe/2 = 316.4 nm，奈奎斯特波數 ν̃_max = 1/(2Δx) = 15798 cm⁻¹。"],"optionsEn":["As long as sample and background are measured on the same day, water vapour and CO₂ cancel completely.","An FTIR uses a fine grating to separate the infrared wavelengths and measures them one at a time.","Sampling at every zero crossing gives Δx = λ_HeNe/2 = 316.4 nm and a Nyquist wavenumber ν̃_max = 1/(2Δx) = 15798 cm⁻¹."],"answer":2,"explanation":"每個零交越取樣一次時 Δx = λ_HeNe/2 = 316.4 nm，奈奎斯特波數 ν̃_max = 1/(2Δx) = 15798 cm⁻¹；每隔一個零交越（Δx = 632.8 nm）為 7899 cm⁻¹，仍涵蓋 KBr 的 7800 cm⁻¹ 上限；每隔三個（Δx = 1.2656 µm）只剩 3950 cm⁻¹，4000 cm⁻¹ 附近的 O–H 伸縮會混疊。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Sampling at every zero crossing gives Δx = λ_HeNe/2 = 316.4 nm and a Nyquist wavenumber ν̃_max = 1/(2Δx) = 15798 cm⁻¹; every second crossing (Δx = 632.8 nm) gives 7899 cm⁻¹, still covering the 7800 cm⁻¹ KBr limit; every fourth (Δx = 1.2656 µm) leaves only 3950 cm⁻¹ and O–H stretches near 4000 cm⁻¹ alias. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":14},{"id":"a431-v12-15","title":"動鏡掃描機構與氦氖取樣：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Scanner mechanics and HeNe fringe sampling: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"],"prerequisiteIds":["a431-v12-14"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「氦氖雷射條紋與零交越取樣」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “HeNe fringes and zero-crossing sampling” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"用示波器同時觀察氦氖正弦條紋與 ADC 觸發脈衝，確認觸發落在零交越且無漏拍；比較不同取樣倍率下的單光束光譜，確認截止波數與 1/(2Δx) 一致；最後刻意改變動鏡速度，確認波數軸不隨速度改變，只有強度頻響改變。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Watch the HeNe sine fringe and the ADC trigger pulses together on an oscilloscope to confirm triggering at the zero crossings with no missed beats; compare single-beam spectra at different sampling ratios to confirm the cutoff equals 1/(2Δx); finally change the mirror velocity deliberately and confirm that the wavenumber axis is unchanged while only the amplitude frequency response shifts. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：氦氖雷射老化或準直偏移使條紋對比下降，零交越偵測開始漏拍，干涉圖取樣位置跳動，光譜出現鬼峰與波數軸漂移；儀器會回報雷射訊號過低，但常被忽略。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: An aging or misaligned HeNe laser lowers fringe contrast, zero-crossing detection starts missing beats, the interferogram sample positions jitter, and ghost peaks and wavenumber drift appear; the instrument reports a low laser signal that is frequently ignored.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a431-v12-15-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"用示波器同時觀察氦氖正弦條紋與 ADC 觸發脈衝，確認觸發落在零交越且無漏拍；比較不同取樣倍率下的單光束光譜，確認截止波數與 1/(2Δx) 一致；最後刻意改變動鏡速度，確認波數軸不隨速度改變，只有強度頻響改變。","textEn":"Watch the HeNe sine fringe and the ADC trigger pulses together on an oscilloscope to confirm triggering at the zero crossings with no missed beats; compare single-beam spectra at different sampling ratios to confirm the cutoff equals 1/(2Δx); finally change the mirror velocity deliberately and confirm that the wavenumber axis is unchanged while only the amplitude frequency response shifts.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"]},{"id":"a431-v12-15-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「動鏡掃描機構與氦氖取樣」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Scanner mechanics and HeNe fringe sampling\"?","options":["用示波器同時觀察氦氖正弦條紋與 ADC 觸發脈衝，確認觸發落在零交越且無漏拍。","不確定度太難估計，報告中只寫最佳值即可。","動鏡走得越遠，解析度就無限提高，與光闌大小無關。"],"optionsEn":["Watch the HeNe sine fringe and the ADC trigger pulses together on an oscilloscope to confirm triggering at the zero crossings with no missed beats.","Uncertainty is too hard to estimate, so the report may state only the best value.","Longer mirror travel keeps improving resolution indefinitely, regardless of aperture size."],"answer":0,"explanation":"用示波器同時觀察氦氖正弦條紋與 ADC 觸發脈衝，確認觸發落在零交越且無漏拍；比較不同取樣倍率下的單光束光譜，確認截止波數與 1/(2Δx) 一致；最後刻意改變動鏡速度，確認波數軸不隨速度改變，只有強度頻響改變。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Watch the HeNe sine fringe and the ADC trigger pulses together on an oscilloscope to confirm triggering at the zero crossings with no missed beats; compare single-beam spectra at different sampling ratios to confirm the cutoff equals 1/(2Δx); finally change the mirror velocity deliberately and confirm that the wavenumber axis is unchanged while only the amplitude frequency response shifts. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":15},{"id":"a431-v12-16","title":"動鏡掃描機構與氦氖取樣：失效診斷","titleEn":"Scanner mechanics and HeNe fringe sampling: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"],"prerequisiteIds":["a431-v12-15"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「氦氖雷射條紋與零交越取樣」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “HeNe fringes and zero-crossing sampling” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"氦氖雷射老化或準直偏移使條紋對比下降，零交越偵測開始漏拍，干涉圖取樣位置跳動，光譜出現鬼峰與波數軸漂移；儀器會回報雷射訊號過低，但常被忽略。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"An aging or misaligned HeNe laser lowers fringe contrast, zero-crossing detection starts missing beats, the interferogram sample positions jitter, and ghost peaks and wavenumber drift appear; the instrument reports a low laser signal that is frequently ignored. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：取樣間隔決定可達的最高波數（奈奎斯特），每個零交越或每隔幾個零交越取樣是依光譜範圍選擇的設定。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The sampling interval sets the highest reachable wavenumber (Nyquist), and sampling at every zero crossing or every few crossings is chosen according to the spectral range.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「氦氖雷射只是幫動鏡對準用的，對波數準確度沒有影響。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"The HeNe laser only helps align the moving mirror and has no effect on wavenumber accuracy.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a431-v12-16-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"氦氖雷射老化或準直偏移使條紋對比下降，零交越偵測開始漏拍，干涉圖取樣位置跳動，光譜出現鬼峰與波數軸漂移；儀器會回報雷射訊號過低，但常被忽略。","textEn":"An aging or misaligned HeNe laser lowers fringe contrast, zero-crossing detection starts missing beats, the interferogram sample positions jitter, and ghost peaks and wavenumber drift appear; the instrument reports a low laser signal that is frequently ignored.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"]},{"id":"a431-v12-16-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「動鏡掃描機構與氦氖取樣」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Scanner mechanics and HeNe fringe sampling\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["先更換最貴的零件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。","氦氖雷射老化或準直偏移使條紋對比下降，零交越偵測開始漏拍，干涉圖取樣位置跳動，光譜出現鬼峰與波數軸漂移；儀器會回報雷射訊號過低，但常被忽略。","因為有氦氖雷射，FTIR 的波數軸永遠不需要校正。"],"optionsEn":["Replace the most expensive part first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.","An aging or misaligned HeNe laser lowers fringe contrast, zero-crossing detection starts missing beats, the interferogram sample positions jitter, and ghost peaks and wavenumber drift appear.","Because of the HeNe laser, an FTIR wavenumber axis never needs calibration."],"answer":1,"explanation":"氦氖雷射老化或準直偏移使條紋對比下降，零交越偵測開始漏拍，干涉圖取樣位置跳動，光譜出現鬼峰與波數軸漂移；儀器會回報雷射訊號過低，但常被忽略。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"An aging or misaligned HeNe laser lowers fringe contrast, zero-crossing detection starts missing beats, the interferogram sample positions jitter, and ghost peaks and wavenumber drift appear; the instrument reports a low laser signal that is frequently ignored. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":16}],"order":2},{"id":"a431-v12-s3","title":"量測、校正與誤差預算","titleEn":"Measurement, calibration and error budgets","description":"本階段聚焦「波數校正與光闌引起的刻度誤差」與「雜訊、掃描次數與解析度的交換」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Wavenumber calibration and aperture-induced scale error\" and \"Noise, scan averaging and the resolution trade\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a431-v12-17","title":"波數校正與光闌引起的刻度誤差：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Wavenumber calibration and aperture-induced scale error: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"],"prerequisiteIds":["a431-v12-16"],"objective":"說明「聚苯乙烯標準片 SRM 1921b」如何決定傅立葉轉換紅外光譜儀的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Polystyrene standard SRM 1921b” determines the key performance of “Fourier-transform infrared spectrometers”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"氦氖雷射給出極好的波數線性，但離軸光線的光程差是 x·cosα，整個光闌錐角內的平均使所有譜線按同一比例向低波數偏移；這是系統性的刻度因子，而非隨機誤差。因此 FTIR 軟體把「有效雷射波數」當作校正參數，用 NIST SRM 1921b 聚苯乙烯片的認證峰位（例如 1601 與 1028 cm⁻¹ 附近的譜帶）去擬合，把刻度拉回正確值；換光闌、換分光鏡或重新對準後都必須重做。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「聚苯乙烯標準片 SRM 1921b」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"The HeNe laser gives excellent wavenumber linearity, but an off-axis ray sees a path difference x·cosα, and averaging over the aperture cone shifts every line toward lower wavenumber by the same fraction; this is a systematic scale factor, not random error. FTIR software therefore treats an effective laser wavenumber as a calibration parameter fitted to the certified peak positions of the NIST SRM 1921b polystyrene film (for example the bands near 1601 and 1028 cm⁻¹) to pull the scale back; it must be redone after any change of aperture, beamsplitter or realignment. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Polystyrene standard SRM 1921b”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：均勻充滿半角 θ 的錐角時 ⟨cosα⟩ = (1 + cosθ)/2 ≈ 1 − θ²/4，故 Δν̃/ν̃ ≈ −θ²/4 = −Ω/(4π)。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: For a uniformly filled cone of half-angle θ, ⟨cosα⟩ = (1 + cosθ)/2 ≈ 1 − θ²/4, hence Δν̃/ν̃ ≈ −θ²/4 = −Ω/(4π).","failure":"常見誤解：「因為有氦氖雷射，FTIR 的波數軸永遠不需要校正。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Because of the HeNe laser, an FTIR wavenumber axis never needs calibration.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「聚苯乙烯標準片 SRM 1921b」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Polystyrene standard SRM 1921b”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a431-v12-17-k1","title":"波數校正與光闌引起的刻度誤差","titleEn":"Wavenumber calibration and aperture-induced scale error","text":"氦氖雷射給出極好的波數線性，但離軸光線的光程差是 x·cosα，整個光闌錐角內的平均使所有譜線按同一比例向低波數偏移；這是系統性的刻度因子，而非隨機誤差。因此 FTIR 軟體把「有效雷射波數」當作校正參數，用 NIST SRM 1921b 聚苯乙烯片的認證峰位（例如 1601 與 1028 cm⁻¹ 附近的譜帶）去擬合，把刻度拉回正確值；換光闌、換分光鏡或重新對準後都必須重做。","textEn":"The HeNe laser gives excellent wavenumber linearity, but an off-axis ray sees a path difference x·cosα, and averaging over the aperture cone shifts every line toward lower wavenumber by the same fraction; this is a systematic scale factor, not random error. FTIR software therefore treats an effective laser wavenumber as a calibration parameter fitted to the certified peak positions of the NIST SRM 1921b polystyrene film (for example the bands near 1601 and 1028 cm⁻¹) to pull the scale back; it must be redone after any change of aperture, beamsplitter or realignment.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"]},{"id":"a431-v12-17-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：因為有氦氖雷射，FTIR 的波數軸永遠不需要校正。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Because of the HeNe laser, an FTIR wavenumber axis never needs calibration. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「波數校正與光闌引起的刻度誤差」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Wavenumber calibration and aperture-induced scale error\" is correct?","options":["因為有氦氖雷射，FTIR 的波數軸永遠不需要校正。","解析度越高光譜越好，掃描次數只是為了美觀。","氦氖雷射給出極好的波數線性，但離軸光線的光程差是 x·cosα，整個光闌錐角內的平均使所有譜線按同一比例向低波數偏移；這是系統性的刻度因子，而非隨機誤差。"],"optionsEn":["Because of the HeNe laser, an FTIR wavenumber axis never needs calibration.","Higher resolution always gives a better spectrum, and scan averaging is merely cosmetic.","The HeNe laser gives excellent wavenumber linearity, but an off-axis ray sees a path difference x·cosα, and averaging over the aperture cone shifts every line toward lower wavenumber by the same fraction."],"answer":2,"explanation":"氦氖雷射給出極好的波數線性，但離軸光線的光程差是 x·cosα，整個光闌錐角內的平均使所有譜線按同一比例向低波數偏移；這是系統性的刻度因子，而非隨機誤差。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"The HeNe laser gives excellent wavenumber linearity, but an off-axis ray sees a path difference x·cosα, and averaging over the aperture cone shifts every line toward lower wavenumber by the same fraction; this is a systematic scale factor, not random error. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":17},{"id":"a431-v12-18","title":"波數校正與光闌引起的刻度誤差：定量估算","titleEn":"Wavenumber calibration and aperture-induced scale error: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"],"prerequisiteIds":["a431-v12-17"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「聚苯乙烯標準片 SRM 1921b」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Polystyrene standard SRM 1921b” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：均勻充滿半角 θ 的錐角時 ⟨cosα⟩ = (1 + cosθ)/2 ≈ 1 − θ²/4，故 Δν̃/ν̃ ≈ −θ²/4 = −Ω/(4π)。取第 2 單元的 θ = 0.0447 rad：Δν̃/ν̃ = −5.0×10⁻⁴，在 2849.5 cm⁻¹ 偏移 −1.42 cm⁻¹、在 1028.3 cm⁻¹ 偏移 −0.51 cm⁻¹，都超過一般 ±1 cm⁻¹ 的驗收容差，所以必須用有效雷射波數修正。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: For a uniformly filled cone of half-angle θ, ⟨cosα⟩ = (1 + cosθ)/2 ≈ 1 − θ²/4, hence Δν̃/ν̃ ≈ −θ²/4 = −Ω/(4π). With θ = 0.0447 rad from unit 2, Δν̃/ν̃ = −5.0×10⁻⁴, a shift of −1.42 cm⁻¹ at 2849.5 cm⁻¹ and −0.51 cm⁻¹ at 1028.3 cm⁻¹, both beyond a typical ±1 cm⁻¹ acceptance tolerance, so the effective-laser-wavenumber correction is mandatory. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：以 4 cm⁻¹、32 次掃描量測 SRM 1921b，用重心法或多項式擬合取峰位，與證書值比較並計算刻度因子；接著把光闌縮小一半重量，確認偏移量按 θ² 縮為四分之一，證明偏移確實來自光闌而非雷射。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Measure SRM 1921b at 4 cm⁻¹ with 32 scans, locate peaks by centroid or polynomial fitting, compare with the certificate values and compute the scale factor; then halve the aperture and remeasure, confirming the shift falls to one quarter as θ² predicts, which proves the offset comes from the aperture rather than the laser.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a431-v12-18-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"均勻充滿半角 θ 的錐角時 ⟨cosα⟩ = (1 + cosθ)/2 ≈ 1 − θ²/4，故 Δν̃/ν̃ ≈ −θ²/4 = −Ω/(4π)。取第 2 單元的 θ = 0.0447 rad：Δν̃/ν̃ = −5.0×10⁻⁴，在 2849.5 cm⁻¹ 偏移 −1.42 cm⁻¹、在 1028.3 cm⁻¹ 偏移 −0.51 cm⁻¹，都超過一般 ±1 cm⁻¹ 的驗收容差，所以必須用有效雷射波數修正。","textEn":"For a uniformly filled cone of half-angle θ, ⟨cosα⟩ = (1 + cosθ)/2 ≈ 1 − θ²/4, hence Δν̃/ν̃ ≈ −θ²/4 = −Ω/(4π). With θ = 0.0447 rad from unit 2, Δν̃/ν̃ = −5.0×10⁻⁴, a shift of −1.42 cm⁻¹ at 2849.5 cm⁻¹ and −0.51 cm⁻¹ at 1028.3 cm⁻¹, both beyond a typical ±1 cm⁻¹ acceptance tolerance, so the effective-laser-wavenumber correction is mandatory.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"]},{"id":"a431-v12-18-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「波數校正與光闌引起的刻度誤差」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Wavenumber calibration and aperture-induced scale error\", which statement holds?","options":["均勻充滿半角 θ 的錐角時 ⟨cosα⟩ = (1 + cosθ)/2 ≈ 1 − θ²/4，故 Δν̃/ν̃ ≈ −θ²/4 = −Ω/(4π)。","儀器自我診斷顯示綠燈，就等於通過性能驗證。","動鏡走得越遠，解析度就無限提高，與光闌大小無關。"],"optionsEn":["For a uniformly filled cone of half-angle θ, ⟨cosα⟩ = (1 + cosθ)/2 ≈ 1 − θ²/4, hence Δν̃/ν̃ ≈ −θ²/4 = −Ω/(4π).","A green self-diagnostic light is the same as passing performance qualification.","Longer mirror travel keeps improving resolution indefinitely, regardless of aperture size."],"answer":0,"explanation":"均勻充滿半角 θ 的錐角時 ⟨cosα⟩ = (1 + cosθ)/2 ≈ 1 − θ²/4，故 Δν̃/ν̃ ≈ −θ²/4 = −Ω/(4π)。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"For a uniformly filled cone of half-angle θ, ⟨cosα⟩ = (1 + cosθ)/2 ≈ 1 − θ²/4, hence Δν̃/ν̃ ≈ −θ²/4 = −Ω/(4π). Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":18},{"id":"a431-v12-19","title":"波數校正與光闌引起的刻度誤差：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Wavenumber calibration and aperture-induced scale error: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"],"prerequisiteIds":["a431-v12-18"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「聚苯乙烯標準片 SRM 1921b」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Polystyrene standard SRM 1921b” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"以 4 cm⁻¹、32 次掃描量測 SRM 1921b，用重心法或多項式擬合取峰位，與證書值比較並計算刻度因子；接著把光闌縮小一半重量，確認偏移量按 θ² 縮為四分之一，證明偏移確實來自光闌而非雷射。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Measure SRM 1921b at 4 cm⁻¹ with 32 scans, locate peaks by centroid or polynomial fitting, compare with the certificate values and compute the scale factor; then halve the aperture and remeasure, confirming the shift falls to one quarter as θ² predicts, which proves the offset comes from the aperture rather than the laser. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：使用者在大光闌下校正、再換到小光闌量測，刻度因子不再適用，譜峰系統性偏移約 1 cm⁻¹，藥典式的聚苯乙烯檢查失敗卻被歸咎於樣品。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Calibrating at a large aperture and then measuring at a small one leaves an unsuitable scale factor, peaks shift systematically by about 1 cm⁻¹, and a pharmacopoeia-style polystyrene check fails while the sample gets the blame.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a431-v12-19-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以 4 cm⁻¹、32 次掃描量測 SRM 1921b，用重心法或多項式擬合取峰位，與證書值比較並計算刻度因子；接著把光闌縮小一半重量，確認偏移量按 θ² 縮為四分之一，證明偏移確實來自光闌而非雷射。","textEn":"Measure SRM 1921b at 4 cm⁻¹ with 32 scans, locate peaks by centroid or polynomial fitting, compare with the certificate values and compute the scale factor; then halve the aperture and remeasure, confirming the shift falls to one quarter as θ² predicts, which proves the offset comes from the aperture rather than the laser.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"]},{"id":"a431-v12-19-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「波數校正與光闌引起的刻度誤差」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Wavenumber calibration and aperture-induced scale error\"?","options":["允收準則可以等看到量測數據後再決定。","以 4 cm⁻¹、32 次掃描量測 SRM 1921b，用重心法或多項式擬合取峰位，與證書值比較並計算刻度因子。","MCT 偵測器在任何情況下都優於 DTGS，所以應該永遠使用 MCT。"],"optionsEn":["Acceptance criteria can be decided after the measured data have been seen.","Measure SRM 1921b at 4 cm⁻¹ with 32 scans, locate peaks by centroid or polynomial fitting, compare with the certificate values and compute the scale factor.","An MCT detector is better than DTGS in every situation, so MCT should always be used."],"answer":1,"explanation":"以 4 cm⁻¹、32 次掃描量測 SRM 1921b，用重心法或多項式擬合取峰位，與證書值比較並計算刻度因子；接著把光闌縮小一半重量，確認偏移量按 θ² 縮為四分之一，證明偏移確實來自光闌而非雷射。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Measure SRM 1921b at 4 cm⁻¹ with 32 scans, locate peaks by centroid or polynomial fitting, compare with the certificate values and compute the scale factor; then halve the aperture and remeasure, confirming the shift falls to one quarter as θ² predicts, which proves the offset comes from the aperture rather than the laser. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":19},{"id":"a431-v12-20","title":"波數校正與光闌引起的刻度誤差：失效診斷","titleEn":"Wavenumber calibration and aperture-induced scale error: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"],"prerequisiteIds":["a431-v12-19"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「聚苯乙烯標準片 SRM 1921b」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Polystyrene standard SRM 1921b” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"使用者在大光闌下校正、再換到小光闌量測，刻度因子不再適用，譜峰系統性偏移約 1 cm⁻¹，藥典式的聚苯乙烯檢查失敗卻被歸咎於樣品。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Calibrating at a large aperture and then measuring at a small one leaves an unsuitable scale factor, peaks shift systematically by about 1 cm⁻¹, and a pharmacopoeia-style polystyrene check fails while the sample gets the blame. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：因此 FTIR 軟體把「有效雷射波數」當作校正參數，用 NIST SRM 1921b 聚苯乙烯片的認證峰位（例如 1601 與 1028 cm⁻¹ 附近的譜帶）去擬合，把刻度拉回正確值；換光闌、換分光鏡或重新對準後都必須重做。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: FTIR software therefore treats an effective laser wavenumber as a calibration parameter fitted to the certified peak positions of the NIST SRM 1921b polystyrene film (for example the bands near 1601 and 1028 cm⁻¹) to pull the scale back; it must be redone after any change of aperture, beamsplitter or realignment.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「因為有氦氖雷射，FTIR 的波數軸永遠不需要校正。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Because of the HeNe laser, an FTIR wavenumber axis never needs calibration.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a431-v12-20-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"使用者在大光闌下校正、再換到小光闌量測，刻度因子不再適用，譜峰系統性偏移約 1 cm⁻¹，藥典式的聚苯乙烯檢查失敗卻被歸咎於樣品。","textEn":"Calibrating at a large aperture and then measuring at a small one leaves an unsuitable scale factor, peaks shift systematically by about 1 cm⁻¹, and a pharmacopoeia-style polystyrene check fails while the sample gets the blame.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"]},{"id":"a431-v12-20-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「波數校正與光闌引起的刻度誤差」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Wavenumber calibration and aperture-induced scale error\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["症狀相同就代表原因相同，不必用量測區分。","解析度越高光譜越好，掃描次數只是為了美觀。","使用者在大光闌下校正、再換到小光闌量測，刻度因子不再適用，譜峰系統性偏移約 1 cm⁻¹，藥典式的聚苯乙烯檢查失敗卻被歸咎於樣品。"],"optionsEn":["Identical symptoms always mean identical causes, so no discriminating measurement is needed.","Higher resolution always gives a better spectrum, and scan averaging is merely cosmetic.","Calibrating at a large aperture and then measuring at a small one leaves an unsuitable scale factor, peaks shift systematically by about 1 cm⁻¹, and a pharmacopoeia-style polystyrene check fails while the sample gets the blame."],"answer":2,"explanation":"使用者在大光闌下校正、再換到小光闌量測，刻度因子不再適用，譜峰系統性偏移約 1 cm⁻¹，藥典式的聚苯乙烯檢查失敗卻被歸咎於樣品。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Calibrating at a large aperture and then measuring at a small one leaves an unsuitable scale factor, peaks shift systematically by about 1 cm⁻¹, and a pharmacopoeia-style polystyrene check fails while the sample gets the blame. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":20},{"id":"a431-v12-21","title":"雜訊、掃描次數與解析度的交換：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Noise, scan averaging and the resolution trade: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"],"prerequisiteIds":["a431-v12-20"],"objective":"說明「100% 線與訊雜比交換規則」如何決定傅立葉轉換紅外光譜儀的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “The 100% line and SNR trading rules” determines the key performance of “Fourier-transform infrared spectrometers”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"FTIR 的雜訊以 100% 線評估：連續取兩次背景光譜相除，理想上應為平坦的 100% T，其峰對峰或均方根偏差就是光度雜訊。偵測器雜訊主導時，訊雜比隨掃描次數的平方根成長；而在固定光闌下，解析度加倍（Δν̃ 減半）使每個光譜元素的能量減半，需要四倍掃描數才能維持同樣的訊雜比；若光闌也依雅基諾條件縮小，代價再乘上四倍。這就是 FTIR 的交換規則，也是規劃量測時間的依據。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「100% 線與訊雜比交換規則」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"FTIR noise is judged with the 100% line: two consecutive background spectra are ratioed and should ideally be a flat 100% T, and their peak-to-peak or RMS deviation is the photometric noise. When detector noise dominates, signal-to-noise grows with the square root of the number of scans; at a fixed aperture, doubling resolution (halving Δν̃) halves the energy per spectral element and needs four times as many scans for the same SNR, and if the stop is also reduced to satisfy the Jacquinot condition the penalty multiplies by another four. These are the FTIR trading rules and the basis for planning measurement time. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “The 100% line and SNR trading rules”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：假設 4 cm⁻¹、32 次掃描、DTGS 的 100% 線峰對峰雜訊 0.05% T，均方根約為峰對峰的 1/5 = 0.01% T = 1×10⁻⁴；換成吸光度約 0.434×10⁻⁴ = 4.3×10⁻⁵ AU，三倍雜訊的偵測極限約 1.3×10⁻⁴ AU。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Assume a DTGS 100% line with 0.05% T peak-to-peak noise at 4 cm⁻¹ and 32 scans; the RMS is about one fifth of that, 0.01% T = 1×10⁻⁴, which in absorbance is 0.434×10⁻⁴ = 4.3×10⁻⁵ AU, with a three-sigma detection limit near 1.3×10⁻⁴ AU.","failure":"常見誤解：「解析度越高光譜越好，掃描次數只是為了美觀。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Higher resolution always gives a better spectrum, and scan averaging is merely cosmetic.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「100% 線與訊雜比交換規則」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “The 100% line and SNR trading rules”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a431-v12-21-k1","title":"雜訊、掃描次數與解析度的交換","titleEn":"Noise, scan averaging and the resolution trade","text":"FTIR 的雜訊以 100% 線評估：連續取兩次背景光譜相除，理想上應為平坦的 100% T，其峰對峰或均方根偏差就是光度雜訊。偵測器雜訊主導時，訊雜比隨掃描次數的平方根成長；而在固定光闌下，解析度加倍（Δν̃ 減半）使每個光譜元素的能量減半，需要四倍掃描數才能維持同樣的訊雜比；若光闌也依雅基諾條件縮小，代價再乘上四倍。","textEn":"FTIR noise is judged with the 100% line: two consecutive background spectra are ratioed and should ideally be a flat 100% T, and their peak-to-peak or RMS deviation is the photometric noise. When detector noise dominates, signal-to-noise grows with the square root of the number of scans; at a fixed aperture, doubling resolution (halving Δν̃) halves the energy per spectral element and needs four times as many scans for the same SNR, and if the stop is also reduced to satisfy the Jacquinot condition the penalty multiplies by another four.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"]},{"id":"a431-v12-21-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：解析度越高光譜越好，掃描次數只是為了美觀。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Higher resolution always gives a better spectrum, and scan averaging is merely cosmetic. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「雜訊、掃描次數與解析度的交換」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Noise, scan averaging and the resolution trade\" is correct?","options":["FTIR 的雜訊以 100% 線評估：連續取兩次背景光譜相除，理想上應為平坦的 100% T，其峰對峰或均方根偏差就是光度雜訊。","解析度越高光譜越好，掃描次數只是為了美觀。","只要樣品與背景在同一天量測，水氣與 CO₂ 就會完全相消。"],"optionsEn":["FTIR noise is judged with the 100% line: two consecutive background spectra are ratioed and should ideally be a flat 100% T, and their peak-to-peak or RMS deviation is the photometric noise.","Higher resolution always gives a better spectrum, and scan averaging is merely cosmetic.","As long as sample and background are measured on the same day, water vapour and CO₂ cancel completely."],"answer":0,"explanation":"FTIR 的雜訊以 100% 線評估：連續取兩次背景光譜相除，理想上應為平坦的 100% T，其峰對峰或均方根偏差就是光度雜訊。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"FTIR noise is judged with the 100% line: two consecutive background spectra are ratioed and should ideally be a flat 100% T, and their peak-to-peak or RMS deviation is the photometric noise. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":21},{"id":"a431-v12-22","title":"雜訊、掃描次數與解析度的交換：定量估算","titleEn":"Noise, scan averaging and the resolution trade: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"],"prerequisiteIds":["a431-v12-21"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「100% 線與訊雜比交換規則」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “The 100% line and SNR trading rules” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：假設 4 cm⁻¹、32 次掃描、DTGS 的 100% 線峰對峰雜訊 0.05% T，均方根約為峰對峰的 1/5 = 0.01% T = 1×10⁻⁴；換成吸光度約 0.434×10⁻⁴ = 4.3×10⁻⁵ AU，三倍雜訊的偵測極限約 1.3×10⁻⁴ AU。改成 256 次掃描（8 倍）雜訊降為 1/√8 = 0.35 倍；若同時改成 2 cm⁻¹，固定光闌下雜訊回升 2 倍，淨改善只剩 1.4 倍。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Assume a DTGS 100% line with 0.05% T peak-to-peak noise at 4 cm⁻¹ and 32 scans; the RMS is about one fifth of that, 0.01% T = 1×10⁻⁴, which in absorbance is 0.434×10⁻⁴ = 4.3×10⁻⁵ AU, with a three-sigma detection limit near 1.3×10⁻⁴ AU. Going to 256 scans (8×) reduces noise by 1/√8 = 0.35; switching at the same time to 2 cm⁻¹ at fixed aperture doubles the noise again, so the net gain is only 1.4×. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：依序以 1、4、16、64 次掃描量 100% 線，在 2200–2100 cm⁻¹ 的無吸收區計算均方根雜訊，畫成對 √N 的曲線確認斜率為 −1/2；若曲線在高掃描數處變平，表示雜訊已由光源閃爍、吹掃不穩或 ADC 量化主導，而非偵測器雜訊。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Record 100% lines at 1, 4, 16 and 64 scans, compute RMS noise in the absorption-free 2200–2100 cm⁻¹ region, and plot against √N to confirm a slope of −1/2; a flattening at high scan counts shows that source flicker, unstable purge or ADC quantisation now dominates rather than detector noise.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a431-v12-22-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"假設 4 cm⁻¹、32 次掃描、DTGS 的 100% 線峰對峰雜訊 0.05% T，均方根約為峰對峰的 1/5 = 0.01% T = 1×10⁻⁴；換成吸光度約 0.434×10⁻⁴ = 4.3×10⁻⁵ AU，三倍雜訊的偵測極限約 1.3×10⁻⁴ AU。改成 256 次掃描（8 倍）雜訊降為 1/√8 = 0.35 倍；若同時改成 2 cm⁻¹，固定光闌下雜訊回升 2 倍，淨改善只剩 1.4 倍。","textEn":"Assume a DTGS 100% line with 0.05% T peak-to-peak noise at 4 cm⁻¹ and 32 scans; the RMS is about one fifth of that, 0.01% T = 1×10⁻⁴, which in absorbance is 0.434×10⁻⁴ = 4.3×10⁻⁵ AU, with a three-sigma detection limit near 1.3×10⁻⁴ AU. Going to 256 scans (8×) reduces noise by 1/√8 = 0.35; switching at the same time to 2 cm⁻¹ at fixed aperture doubles the noise again, so the net gain is only 1.4×.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"]},{"id":"a431-v12-22-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「雜訊、掃描次數與解析度的交換」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Noise, scan averaging and the resolution trade\", which statement holds?","options":["FTIR 是用某種精密光柵把紅外光分成各個波長後逐一量測。","假設 4 cm⁻¹、32 次掃描、DTGS 的 100% 線峰對峰雜訊 0.05% T，均方根約為峰對峰的 1/5 = 0.01% T = 1×10⁻⁴。","MCT 偵測器在任何情況下都優於 DTGS，所以應該永遠使用 MCT。"],"optionsEn":["An FTIR uses a fine grating to separate the infrared wavelengths and measures them one at a time.","Assume a DTGS 100% line with 0.05% T peak-to-peak noise at 4 cm⁻¹ and 32 scans.","An MCT detector is better than DTGS in every situation, so MCT should always be used."],"answer":1,"explanation":"假設 4 cm⁻¹、32 次掃描、DTGS 的 100% 線峰對峰雜訊 0.05% T，均方根約為峰對峰的 1/5 = 0.01% T = 1×10⁻⁴；換成吸光度約 0.434×10⁻⁴ = 4.3×10⁻⁵ AU，三倍雜訊的偵測極限約 1.3×10⁻⁴ AU。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Assume a DTGS 100% line with 0.05% T peak-to-peak noise at 4 cm⁻¹ and 32 scans; the RMS is about one fifth of that, 0.01% T = 1×10⁻⁴, which in absorbance is 0.434×10⁻⁴ = 4.3×10⁻⁵ AU, with a three-sigma detection limit near 1.3×10⁻⁴ AU. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":22},{"id":"a431-v12-23","title":"雜訊、掃描次數與解析度的交換：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Noise, scan averaging and the resolution trade: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"],"prerequisiteIds":["a431-v12-22"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「100% 線與訊雜比交換規則」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “The 100% line and SNR trading rules” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"依序以 1、4、16、64 次掃描量 100% 線，在 2200–2100 cm⁻¹ 的無吸收區計算均方根雜訊，畫成對 √N 的曲線確認斜率為 −1/2；若曲線在高掃描數處變平，表示雜訊已由光源閃爍、吹掃不穩或 ADC 量化主導，而非偵測器雜訊。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Record 100% lines at 1, 4, 16 and 64 scans, compute RMS noise in the absorption-free 2200–2100 cm⁻¹ region, and plot against √N to confirm a slope of −1/2; a flattening at high scan counts shows that source flicker, unstable purge or ADC quantisation now dominates rather than detector noise. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：把 0.5 cm⁻¹ 解析度當預設值用來量測固體薄膜，訊雜比比 4 cm⁻¹ 差一個數量級、量測時間拉長數十倍，而固體譜帶本身寬達 10–20 cm⁻¹，根本不需要那樣的解析度。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Using 0.5 cm⁻¹ as the default resolution for solid films costs an order of magnitude in signal-to-noise and tens of times longer measurements, while solid bands are 10–20 cm⁻¹ wide and never needed that resolution.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a431-v12-23-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"依序以 1、4、16、64 次掃描量 100% 線，在 2200–2100 cm⁻¹ 的無吸收區計算均方根雜訊，畫成對 √N 的曲線確認斜率為 −1/2；若曲線在高掃描數處變平，表示雜訊已由光源閃爍、吹掃不穩或 ADC 量化主導，而非偵測器雜訊。","textEn":"Record 100% lines at 1, 4, 16 and 64 scans, compute RMS noise in the absorption-free 2200–2100 cm⁻¹ region, and plot against √N to confirm a slope of −1/2; a flattening at high scan counts shows that source flicker, unstable purge or ADC quantisation now dominates rather than detector noise.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"]},{"id":"a431-v12-23-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「雜訊、掃描次數與解析度的交換」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Noise, scan averaging and the resolution trade\"?","options":["只要模擬結果看起來合理，就可以省略實體量測與校正。","氦氖雷射只是幫動鏡對準用的，對波數準確度沒有影響。","依序以 1、4、16、64 次掃描量 100% 線，在 2200–2100 cm⁻¹ 的無吸收區計算均方根雜訊，畫成對 √N 的曲線確認斜率為 −1/2。"],"optionsEn":["If the simulation looks reasonable, physical measurement and calibration can be skipped.","The HeNe laser only helps align the moving mirror and has no effect on wavenumber accuracy.","Record 100% lines at 1, 4, 16 and 64 scans, compute RMS noise in the absorption-free 2200–2100 cm⁻¹ region, and plot against √N to confirm a slope of −1/2."],"answer":2,"explanation":"依序以 1、4、16、64 次掃描量 100% 線，在 2200–2100 cm⁻¹ 的無吸收區計算均方根雜訊，畫成對 √N 的曲線確認斜率為 −1/2；若曲線在高掃描數處變平，表示雜訊已由光源閃爍、吹掃不穩或 ADC 量化主導，而非偵測器雜訊。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Record 100% lines at 1, 4, 16 and 64 scans, compute RMS noise in the absorption-free 2200–2100 cm⁻¹ region, and plot against √N to confirm a slope of −1/2; a flattening at high scan counts shows that source flicker, unstable purge or ADC quantisation now dominates rather than detector noise. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":23},{"id":"a431-v12-24","title":"雜訊、掃描次數與解析度的交換：失效診斷","titleEn":"Noise, scan averaging and the resolution trade: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"],"prerequisiteIds":["a431-v12-23"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「100% 線與訊雜比交換規則」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “The 100% line and SNR trading rules” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"把 0.5 cm⁻¹ 解析度當預設值用來量測固體薄膜，訊雜比比 4 cm⁻¹ 差一個數量級、量測時間拉長數十倍，而固體譜帶本身寬達 10–20 cm⁻¹，根本不需要那樣的解析度。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Using 0.5 cm⁻¹ as the default resolution for solid films costs an order of magnitude in signal-to-noise and tens of times longer measurements, while solid bands are 10–20 cm⁻¹ wide and never needed that resolution. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：這就是 FTIR 的交換規則，也是規劃量測時間的依據。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: These are the FTIR trading rules and the basis for planning measurement time.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「解析度越高光譜越好，掃描次數只是為了美觀。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Higher resolution always gives a better spectrum, and scan averaging is merely cosmetic.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a431-v12-24-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"把 0.5 cm⁻¹ 解析度當預設值用來量測固體薄膜，訊雜比比 4 cm⁻¹ 差一個數量級、量測時間拉長數十倍，而固體譜帶本身寬達 10–20 cm⁻¹，根本不需要那樣的解析度。","textEn":"Using 0.5 cm⁻¹ as the default resolution for solid films costs an order of magnitude in signal-to-noise and tens of times longer measurements, while solid bands are 10–20 cm⁻¹ wide and never needed that resolution.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"]},{"id":"a431-v12-24-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「雜訊、掃描次數與解析度的交換」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Noise, scan averaging and the resolution trade\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["把 0.5 cm⁻¹ 解析度當預設值用來量測固體薄膜，訊雜比比 4 cm⁻¹ 差一個數量級、量測時間拉長數十倍，而固體譜帶本身寬達 10–20 cm⁻¹，根本不需要那樣的解析度。","只要重新開機或重設軟體，硬體失效也會一併排除。","只要樣品與背景在同一天量測，水氣與 CO₂ 就會完全相消。"],"optionsEn":["Using 0.5 cm⁻¹ as the default resolution for solid films costs an order of magnitude in signal-to-noise and tens of times longer measurements, while solid bands are 10–20 cm⁻¹ wide and never needed that resolution.","Restarting or resetting the software also clears hardware failures.","As long as sample and background are measured on the same day, water vapour and CO₂ cancel completely."],"answer":0,"explanation":"把 0.5 cm⁻¹ 解析度當預設值用來量測固體薄膜，訊雜比比 4 cm⁻¹ 差一個數量級、量測時間拉長數十倍，而固體譜帶本身寬達 10–20 cm⁻¹，根本不需要那樣的解析度。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Using 0.5 cm⁻¹ as the default resolution for solid films costs an order of magnitude in signal-to-noise and tens of times longer measurements, while solid bands are 10–20 cm⁻¹ wide and never needed that resolution. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":24}],"order":3},{"id":"a431-v12-s4","title":"系統整合、驗證與工程交接","titleEn":"Integration, validation and engineering handoff","description":"本階段聚焦「水氣、二氧化碳與樣品介面整合」與「性能驗證、驗收準則與工程交接」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Water vapour, CO₂ and sample-interface integration\" and \"Performance qualification, acceptance criteria and handoff\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a431-v12-25","title":"水氣、二氧化碳與樣品介面整合：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Water vapour, CO₂ and sample-interface integration: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"],"prerequisiteIds":["a431-v12-24"],"objective":"說明「乾燥吹掃與樣品室」如何決定傅立葉轉換紅外光譜儀的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Dry purge and the sample compartment” determines the key performance of “Fourier-transform infrared spectrometers”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"大氣水氣在 1300–1900 與 3500–3900 cm⁻¹ 有密集的轉動—振動譜線，CO₂ 在 2350 cm⁻¹ 有強雙峰、667 cm⁻¹ 有彎曲振動；它們在樣品與背景之間若有任何變化，就會以正負尖刺的形式疊在樣品光譜上。工程解法是把干涉儀與偵測器腔密封並放乾燥劑，樣品室以乾燥空氣或氮氣吹掃，並在換樣品後等待吹掃恢復；ATR 附件把路徑縮到一次漸逝波深度，是另一種同時降低氣體干擾與樣品製備負擔的介面。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「乾燥吹掃與樣品室」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Atmospheric water vapour has dense rotation–vibration lines in the 1300–1900 and 3500–3900 cm⁻¹ regions, and CO₂ has a strong doublet at 2350 cm⁻¹ and a bending mode at 667 cm⁻¹; any change between sample and background measurements appears as positive or negative spikes on the sample spectrum. The engineering answer is to seal the interferometer and detector compartments with desiccant, purge the sample compartment with dry air or nitrogen, and wait for purge recovery after each sample exchange; an ATR accessory shortens the path to a single evanescent depth and is another interface that reduces both gas interference and sample preparation. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Dry purge and the sample compartment”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：20 °C、相對濕度 50% 時水氣分壓 p ≈ 0.5×2.34 kPa = 1.17 kPa，分子數密度 n = p/(k_B T) = 1170/(1.38×10⁻²³×293) ≈ 2.9×10¹⁷ cm⁻³；吹掃到露點 −40 °C（p ≈ 12.8 Pa）後 n ≈ 3.2×10¹⁵ cm⁻³，降低約 90 倍。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: At 20 °C and 50% relative humidity the water partial pressure is p ≈ 0.5×2.34 kPa = 1.17 kPa and the number density n = p/(k_B T) = 1170/(1.38×10⁻²³×293) ≈ 2.9×10¹⁷ cm⁻³; purging to a −40 °C dew point (p ≈ 12.8 Pa) gives n ≈ 3.2×10¹⁵ cm⁻³, about 90 times lower.","failure":"常見誤解：「只要樣品與背景在同一天量測，水氣與 CO₂ 就會完全相消。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"As long as sample and background are measured on the same day, water vapour and CO₂ cancel completely.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「乾燥吹掃與樣品室」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Dry purge and the sample compartment”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a431-v12-25-k1","title":"水氣、二氧化碳與樣品介面整合","titleEn":"Water vapour, CO₂ and sample-interface integration","text":"大氣水氣在 1300–1900 與 3500–3900 cm⁻¹ 有密集的轉動—振動譜線，CO₂ 在 2350 cm⁻¹ 有強雙峰、667 cm⁻¹ 有彎曲振動；它們在樣品與背景之間若有任何變化，就會以正負尖刺的形式疊在樣品光譜上。工程解法是把干涉儀與偵測器腔密封並放乾燥劑，樣品室以乾燥空氣或氮氣吹掃，並在換樣品後等待吹掃恢復；ATR 附件把路徑縮到一次漸逝波深度，是另一種同時降低氣體干擾與樣品製備負擔的介面。","textEn":"Atmospheric water vapour has dense rotation–vibration lines in the 1300–1900 and 3500–3900 cm⁻¹ regions, and CO₂ has a strong doublet at 2350 cm⁻¹ and a bending mode at 667 cm⁻¹; any change between sample and background measurements appears as positive or negative spikes on the sample spectrum. The engineering answer is to seal the interferometer and detector compartments with desiccant, purge the sample compartment with dry air or nitrogen, and wait for purge recovery after each sample exchange; an ATR accessory shortens the path to a single evanescent depth and is another interface that reduces both gas interference and sample preparation.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"]},{"id":"a431-v12-25-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：只要樣品與背景在同一天量測，水氣與 CO₂ 就會完全相消。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: As long as sample and background are measured on the same day, water vapour and CO₂ cancel completely. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「水氣、二氧化碳與樣品介面整合」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Water vapour, CO₂ and sample-interface integration\" is correct?","options":["只要樣品與背景在同一天量測，水氣與 CO₂ 就會完全相消。","大氣水氣在 1300–1900 與 3500–3900 cm⁻¹ 有密集的轉動—振動譜線，CO₂ 在 2350 cm⁻¹ 有強雙峰、667 cm⁻¹ 有彎曲振動。","儀器自我診斷顯示綠燈，就等於通過性能驗證。"],"optionsEn":["As long as sample and background are measured on the same day, water vapour and CO₂ cancel completely.","Atmospheric water vapour has dense rotation–vibration lines in the 1300–1900 and 3500–3900 cm⁻¹ regions, and CO₂ has a strong doublet at 2350 cm⁻¹ and a bending mode at 667 cm⁻¹.","A green self-diagnostic light is the same as passing performance qualification."],"answer":1,"explanation":"大氣水氣在 1300–1900 與 3500–3900 cm⁻¹ 有密集的轉動—振動譜線，CO₂ 在 2350 cm⁻¹ 有強雙峰、667 cm⁻¹ 有彎曲振動；它們在樣品與背景之間若有任何變化，就會以正負尖刺的形式疊在樣品光譜上。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Atmospheric water vapour has dense rotation–vibration lines in the 1300–1900 and 3500–3900 cm⁻¹ regions, and CO₂ has a strong doublet at 2350 cm⁻¹ and a bending mode at 667 cm⁻¹; any change between sample and background measurements appears as positive or negative spikes on the sample spectrum. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":25},{"id":"a431-v12-26","title":"水氣、二氧化碳與樣品介面整合：定量估算","titleEn":"Water vapour, CO₂ and sample-interface integration: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"],"prerequisiteIds":["a431-v12-25"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「乾燥吹掃與樣品室」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Dry purge and the sample compartment” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：20 °C、相對濕度 50% 時水氣分壓 p ≈ 0.5×2.34 kPa = 1.17 kPa，分子數密度 n = p/(k_B T) = 1170/(1.38×10⁻²³×293) ≈ 2.9×10¹⁷ cm⁻³；吹掃到露點 −40 °C（p ≈ 12.8 Pa）後 n ≈ 3.2×10¹⁵ cm⁻³，降低約 90 倍。20 cm 樣品室路徑的水氣柱密度因此從 5.8×10¹⁸ cm⁻² 降到 6.3×10¹⁶ cm⁻²。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: At 20 °C and 50% relative humidity the water partial pressure is p ≈ 0.5×2.34 kPa = 1.17 kPa and the number density n = p/(k_B T) = 1170/(1.38×10⁻²³×293) ≈ 2.9×10¹⁷ cm⁻³; purging to a −40 °C dew point (p ≈ 12.8 Pa) gives n ≈ 3.2×10¹⁵ cm⁻³, about 90 times lower. Over a 20 cm sample-compartment path the water column therefore drops from 5.8×10¹⁸ cm⁻² to 6.3×10¹⁶ cm⁻². Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：開啟樣品室蓋 30 秒再關上，連續每 30 秒取一次 100% 線，觀察 1600 cm⁻¹ 水氣尖刺的衰減時間常數，據此訂出換樣後的等待時間；同時用露點計確認吹掃氣體露點低於 −40 °C，並檢查 2350 cm⁻¹ 的 CO₂ 殘留是否低於光度雜訊。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Open the sample-compartment lid for 30 s, close it and take a 100% line every 30 s to watch the decay time constant of the 1600 cm⁻¹ water spikes, then set the post-exchange waiting time from it; verify with a dew-point meter that the purge gas is below −40 °C and check that the residual 2350 cm⁻¹ CO₂ feature is below the photometric noise.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a431-v12-26-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"20 °C、相對濕度 50% 時水氣分壓 p ≈ 0.5×2.34 kPa = 1.17 kPa，分子數密度 n = p/(k_B T) = 1170/(1.38×10⁻²³×293) ≈ 2.9×10¹⁷ cm⁻³；吹掃到露點 −40 °C（p ≈ 12.8 Pa）後 n ≈ 3.2×10¹⁵ cm⁻³，降低約 90 倍。20 cm 樣品室路徑的水氣柱密度因此從 5.8×10¹⁸ cm⁻² 降到 6.3×10¹⁶ cm⁻²。","textEn":"At 20 °C and 50% relative humidity the water partial pressure is p ≈ 0.5×2.34 kPa = 1.17 kPa and the number density n = p/(k_B T) = 1170/(1.38×10⁻²³×293) ≈ 2.9×10¹⁷ cm⁻³; purging to a −40 °C dew point (p ≈ 12.8 Pa) gives n ≈ 3.2×10¹⁵ cm⁻³, about 90 times lower. Over a 20 cm sample-compartment path the water column therefore drops from 5.8×10¹⁸ cm⁻² to 6.3×10¹⁶ cm⁻².","sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"]},{"id":"a431-v12-26-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「水氣、二氧化碳與樣品介面整合」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Water vapour, CO₂ and sample-interface integration\", which statement holds?","options":["動鏡走得越遠，解析度就無限提高，與光闌大小無關。","氦氖雷射只是幫動鏡對準用的，對波數準確度沒有影響。","20 °C、相對濕度 50% 時水氣分壓 p ≈ 0.5×2.34 kPa = 1.17 kPa，分子數密度 n = p/(k_B T) = 1170/(1.38×10⁻²³×293) ≈ 2.9×10¹⁷ cm⁻³。"],"optionsEn":["Longer mirror travel keeps improving resolution indefinitely, regardless of aperture size.","The HeNe laser only helps align the moving mirror and has no effect on wavenumber accuracy.","At 20 °C and 50% relative humidity the water partial pressure is p ≈ 0.5×2.34 kPa = 1.17 kPa and the number density n = p/(k_B T) = 1170/(1.38×10⁻²³×293) ≈ 2.9×10¹⁷ cm⁻³."],"answer":2,"explanation":"20 °C、相對濕度 50% 時水氣分壓 p ≈ 0.5×2.34 kPa = 1.17 kPa，分子數密度 n = p/(k_B T) = 1170/(1.38×10⁻²³×293) ≈ 2.9×10¹⁷ cm⁻³；吹掃到露點 −40 °C（p ≈ 12.8 Pa）後 n ≈ 3.2×10¹⁵ cm⁻³，降低約 90 倍。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"At 20 °C and 50% relative humidity the water partial pressure is p ≈ 0.5×2.34 kPa = 1.17 kPa and the number density n = p/(k_B T) = 1170/(1.38×10⁻²³×293) ≈ 2.9×10¹⁷ cm⁻³; purging to a −40 °C dew point (p ≈ 12.8 Pa) gives n ≈ 3.2×10¹⁵ cm⁻³, about 90 times lower. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":26},{"id":"a431-v12-27","title":"水氣、二氧化碳與樣品介面整合：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Water vapour, CO₂ and sample-interface integration: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"],"prerequisiteIds":["a431-v12-26"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「乾燥吹掃與樣品室」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Dry purge and the sample compartment” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"開啟樣品室蓋 30 秒再關上，連續每 30 秒取一次 100% 線，觀察 1600 cm⁻¹ 水氣尖刺的衰減時間常數，據此訂出換樣後的等待時間；同時用露點計確認吹掃氣體露點低於 −40 °C，並檢查 2350 cm⁻¹ 的 CO₂ 殘留是否低於光度雜訊。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Open the sample-compartment lid for 30 s, close it and take a 100% line every 30 s to watch the decay time constant of the 1600 cm⁻¹ water spikes, then set the post-exchange waiting time from it; verify with a dew-point meter that the purge gas is below −40 °C and check that the residual 2350 cm⁻¹ CO₂ feature is below the photometric noise. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：吹掃氣管接到含油的壓縮空氣，光譜在 2900 cm⁻¹ 附近出現 C–H 伸縮鬼峰並隨時間增長，實驗室花數週追查「樣品污染」，問題其實在氣源。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Connecting the purge line to oil-laden compressed air produces C–H stretch ghost bands near 2900 cm⁻¹ that grow with time, and the laboratory spends weeks hunting sample contamination that actually comes from the gas supply.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a431-v12-27-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"開啟樣品室蓋 30 秒再關上，連續每 30 秒取一次 100% 線，觀察 1600 cm⁻¹ 水氣尖刺的衰減時間常數，據此訂出換樣後的等待時間；同時用露點計確認吹掃氣體露點低於 −40 °C，並檢查 2350 cm⁻¹ 的 CO₂ 殘留是否低於光度雜訊。","textEn":"Open the sample-compartment lid for 30 s, close it and take a 100% line every 30 s to watch the decay time constant of the 1600 cm⁻¹ water spikes, then set the post-exchange waiting time from it; verify with a dew-point meter that the purge gas is below −40 °C and check that the residual 2350 cm⁻¹ CO₂ feature is below the photometric noise.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"]},{"id":"a431-v12-27-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「水氣、二氧化碳與樣品介面整合」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Water vapour, CO₂ and sample-interface integration\"?","options":["開啟樣品室蓋 30 秒再關上，連續每 30 秒取一次 100% 線，觀察 1600 cm⁻¹ 水氣尖刺的衰減時間常數，據此訂出換樣後的等待時間。","量測時不必記錄溫度、振動與時間等條件，因為它們不會影響結果。","因為有氦氖雷射，FTIR 的波數軸永遠不需要校正。"],"optionsEn":["Open the sample-compartment lid for 30 s, close it and take a 100% line every 30 s to watch the decay time constant of the 1600 cm⁻¹ water spikes, then set the post-exchange waiting time from it.","Temperature, vibration and timing need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","Because of the HeNe laser, an FTIR wavenumber axis never needs calibration."],"answer":0,"explanation":"開啟樣品室蓋 30 秒再關上，連續每 30 秒取一次 100% 線，觀察 1600 cm⁻¹ 水氣尖刺的衰減時間常數，據此訂出換樣後的等待時間；同時用露點計確認吹掃氣體露點低於 −40 °C，並檢查 2350 cm⁻¹ 的 CO₂ 殘留是否低於光度雜訊。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Open the sample-compartment lid for 30 s, close it and take a 100% line every 30 s to watch the decay time constant of the 1600 cm⁻¹ water spikes, then set the post-exchange waiting time from it; verify with a dew-point meter that the purge gas is below −40 °C and check that the residual 2350 cm⁻¹ CO₂ feature is below the photometric noise. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":27},{"id":"a431-v12-28","title":"水氣、二氧化碳與樣品介面整合：失效診斷","titleEn":"Water vapour, CO₂ and sample-interface integration: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"],"prerequisiteIds":["a431-v12-27"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「乾燥吹掃與樣品室」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Dry purge and the sample compartment” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"吹掃氣管接到含油的壓縮空氣，光譜在 2900 cm⁻¹ 附近出現 C–H 伸縮鬼峰並隨時間增長，實驗室花數週追查「樣品污染」，問題其實在氣源。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Connecting the purge line to oil-laden compressed air produces C–H stretch ghost bands near 2900 cm⁻¹ that grow with time, and the laboratory spends weeks hunting sample contamination that actually comes from the gas supply. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：工程解法是把干涉儀與偵測器腔密封並放乾燥劑，樣品室以乾燥空氣或氮氣吹掃，並在換樣品後等待吹掃恢復；ATR 附件把路徑縮到一次漸逝波深度，是另一種同時降低氣體干擾與樣品製備負擔的介面。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The engineering answer is to seal the interferometer and detector compartments with desiccant, purge the sample compartment with dry air or nitrogen, and wait for purge recovery after each sample exchange; an ATR accessory shortens the path to a single evanescent depth and is another interface that reduces both gas interference and sample preparation.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「只要樣品與背景在同一天量測，水氣與 CO₂ 就會完全相消。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"As long as sample and background are measured on the same day, water vapour and CO₂ cancel completely.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a431-v12-28-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"吹掃氣管接到含油的壓縮空氣，光譜在 2900 cm⁻¹ 附近出現 C–H 伸縮鬼峰並隨時間增長，實驗室花數週追查「樣品污染」，問題其實在氣源。","textEn":"Connecting the purge line to oil-laden compressed air produces C–H stretch ghost bands near 2900 cm⁻¹ that grow with time, and the laboratory spends weeks hunting sample contamination that actually comes from the gas supply.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"]},{"id":"a431-v12-28-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「水氣、二氧化碳與樣品介面整合」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Water vapour, CO₂ and sample-interface integration\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自操作人員失誤，系統設計不需要檢討。","吹掃氣管接到含油的壓縮空氣，光譜在 2900 cm⁻¹ 附近出現 C–H 伸縮鬼峰並隨時間增長，實驗室花數週追查「樣品污染」，問題其實在氣源。","儀器自我診斷顯示綠燈，就等於通過性能驗證。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is operator error, so the system design never needs review.","Connecting the purge line to oil-laden compressed air produces C–H stretch ghost bands near 2900 cm⁻¹ that grow with time, and the laboratory spends weeks hunting sample contamination that actually comes from the gas supply.","A green self-diagnostic light is the same as passing performance qualification."],"answer":1,"explanation":"吹掃氣管接到含油的壓縮空氣，光譜在 2900 cm⁻¹ 附近出現 C–H 伸縮鬼峰並隨時間增長，實驗室花數週追查「樣品污染」，問題其實在氣源。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Connecting the purge line to oil-laden compressed air produces C–H stretch ghost bands near 2900 cm⁻¹ that grow with time, and the laboratory spends weeks hunting sample contamination that actually comes from the gas supply. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":28},{"id":"a431-v12-29","title":"性能驗證、驗收準則與工程交接：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Performance qualification, acceptance criteria and handoff: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"],"prerequisiteIds":["a431-v12-28"],"objective":"說明「性能驗證報告」如何決定傅立葉轉換紅外光譜儀的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Performance-qualification record” determines the key performance of “Fourier-transform infrared spectrometers”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"一台 FTIR 的交接不是看規格書，而是以同一套可重複的測試把波數準確度、解析度、光度雜訊、能量通量與穩定性鎖成基準：聚苯乙烯峰位在容差內、2870 與 2851 cm⁻¹ 之間的穿透率差大於規定值、100% 線雜訊低於門檻、單光束能量不低於出廠基準的某個百分比、氦氖與光源強度在診斷頁面正常。這些數據連同光闌、速度、取樣倍率、切趾等設定一起寫入驗收報告，日後任何維修或漂移都與它比對。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「性能驗證報告」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Handing over an FTIR is not a matter of reading the datasheet but of locking wavenumber accuracy, resolution, photometric noise, energy throughput and stability into a baseline with one repeatable test set: polystyrene peaks within tolerance, the transmittance difference between 2870 and 2851 cm⁻¹ above the specified value, 100% line noise below threshold, single-beam energy not below a stated fraction of the factory baseline, and HeNe and source levels normal on the diagnostic page. These results, together with aperture, velocity, sampling ratio and apodization settings, go into the qualification record against which every later repair or drift is compared. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Performance-qualification record”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：峰位重複性的量級估計為 σ_ν̃ ≈ FWHM/SNR：聚苯乙烯 1601 cm⁻¹ 譜帶在 4 cm⁻¹ 下的視線寬約 8 cm⁻¹，峰值訊雜比 500 時 σ_ν̃ ≈ 0.016 cm⁻¹；連續量 10 次的標準差若明顯大於 0.02 cm⁻¹，表示取樣或雷射有問題。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: An order-of-magnitude estimate of peak repeatability is σ_ν̃ ≈ FWHM/SNR: the polystyrene 1601 cm⁻¹ band appears about 8 cm⁻¹ wide at 4 cm⁻¹ resolution, so at a peak SNR of 500, σ_ν̃ ≈ 0.016 cm⁻¹; if the standard deviation of 10 consecutive runs is clearly above 0.02 cm⁻¹, sampling or laser trouble is indicated.","failure":"常見誤解：「儀器自我診斷顯示綠燈，就等於通過性能驗證。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A green self-diagnostic light is the same as passing performance qualification.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「性能驗證報告」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Performance-qualification record”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a431-v12-29-k1","title":"性能驗證、驗收準則與工程交接","titleEn":"Performance qualification, acceptance criteria and handoff","text":"一台 FTIR 的交接不是看規格書，而是以同一套可重複的測試把波數準確度、解析度、光度雜訊、能量通量與穩定性鎖成基準：聚苯乙烯峰位在容差內、2870 與 2851 cm⁻¹ 之間的穿透率差大於規定值、100% 線雜訊低於門檻、單光束能量不低於出廠基準的某個百分比、氦氖與光源強度在診斷頁面正常。這些數據連同光闌、速度、取樣倍率、切趾等設定一起寫入驗收報告，日後任何維修或漂移都與它比對。","textEn":"Handing over an FTIR is not a matter of reading the datasheet but of locking wavenumber accuracy, resolution, photometric noise, energy throughput and stability into a baseline with one repeatable test set: polystyrene peaks within tolerance, the transmittance difference between 2870 and 2851 cm⁻¹ above the specified value, 100% line noise below threshold, single-beam energy not below a stated fraction of the factory baseline, and HeNe and source levels normal on the diagnostic page. These results, together with aperture, velocity, sampling ratio and apodization settings, go into the qualification record against which every later repair or drift is compared.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"]},{"id":"a431-v12-29-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：儀器自我診斷顯示綠燈，就等於通過性能驗證。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A green self-diagnostic light is the same as passing performance qualification. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「性能驗證、驗收準則與工程交接」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Performance qualification, acceptance criteria and handoff\" is correct?","options":["儀器自我診斷顯示綠燈，就等於通過性能驗證。","FTIR 是用某種精密光柵把紅外光分成各個波長後逐一量測。","一台 FTIR 的交接不是看規格書，而是以同一套可重複的測試把波數準確度、解析度、光度雜訊、能量通量與穩定性鎖成基準：聚苯乙烯峰位在容差內、2870 與 2851 cm⁻¹ 之間的穿透率差大於規定值、100% 線雜訊低於門檻、單光束能量不低於出廠基準的某個百分比、氦氖與光源強度在診斷頁面正常。"],"optionsEn":["A green self-diagnostic light is the same as passing performance qualification.","An FTIR uses a fine grating to separate the infrared wavelengths and measures them one at a time.","Handing over an FTIR is not a matter of reading the datasheet but of locking wavenumber accuracy, resolution, photometric noise, energy throughput and stability into a baseline with one repeatable test set: polystyrene peaks within tolerance, the transmittance difference between 2870 and 2851 cm⁻¹ above the specified value, 100% line noise below threshold, single-beam energy not below a stated fraction of the factory baseline, and HeNe and source levels normal on the diagnostic page."],"answer":2,"explanation":"一台 FTIR 的交接不是看規格書，而是以同一套可重複的測試把波數準確度、解析度、光度雜訊、能量通量與穩定性鎖成基準：聚苯乙烯峰位在容差內、2870 與 2851 cm⁻¹ 之間的穿透率差大於規定值、100% 線雜訊低於門檻、單光束能量不低於出廠基準的某個百分比、氦氖與光源強度在診斷頁面正常。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Handing over an FTIR is not a matter of reading the datasheet but of locking wavenumber accuracy, resolution, photometric noise, energy throughput and stability into a baseline with one repeatable test set: polystyrene peaks within tolerance, the transmittance difference between 2870 and 2851 cm⁻¹ above the specified value, 100% line noise below threshold, single-beam energy not below a stated fraction of the factory baseline, and HeNe and source levels normal on the diagnostic page. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":29},{"id":"a431-v12-30","title":"性能驗證、驗收準則與工程交接：定量估算","titleEn":"Performance qualification, acceptance criteria and handoff: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"],"prerequisiteIds":["a431-v12-29"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「性能驗證報告」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Performance-qualification record” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：峰位重複性的量級估計為 σ_ν̃ ≈ FWHM/SNR：聚苯乙烯 1601 cm⁻¹ 譜帶在 4 cm⁻¹ 下的視線寬約 8 cm⁻¹，峰值訊雜比 500 時 σ_ν̃ ≈ 0.016 cm⁻¹；連續量 10 次的標準差若明顯大於 0.02 cm⁻¹，表示取樣或雷射有問題。驗收容差依藥典慣例取 ±1 cm⁻¹，兩者相差 50 倍，所以漂移可以被及早發現。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: An order-of-magnitude estimate of peak repeatability is σ_ν̃ ≈ FWHM/SNR: the polystyrene 1601 cm⁻¹ band appears about 8 cm⁻¹ wide at 4 cm⁻¹ resolution, so at a peak SNR of 500, σ_ν̃ ≈ 0.016 cm⁻¹; if the standard deviation of 10 consecutive runs is clearly above 0.02 cm⁻¹, sampling or laser trouble is indicated. The acceptance tolerance follows pharmacopoeia practice at ±1 cm⁻¹, 50 times larger, so drift can be caught early. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：建立一份含日期、設定與結果的性能驗證表，每月重跑：聚苯乙烯峰位、解析度測試、100% 線雜訊、單光束能量、雷射與光源診斷值；把每項畫成管制圖，任何一項超出歷史平均 ±3σ 就啟動維修，而不是等到樣品結果異常。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Create a performance-qualification sheet with date, settings and results and rerun it monthly: polystyrene peak positions, the resolution test, 100% line noise, single-beam energy, laser and source diagnostics; plot each as a control chart and trigger maintenance when any item leaves its historical mean by ±3σ rather than waiting for abnormal sample results.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a431-v12-30-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"峰位重複性的量級估計為 σ_ν̃ ≈ FWHM/SNR：聚苯乙烯 1601 cm⁻¹ 譜帶在 4 cm⁻¹ 下的視線寬約 8 cm⁻¹，峰值訊雜比 500 時 σ_ν̃ ≈ 0.016 cm⁻¹；連續量 10 次的標準差若明顯大於 0.02 cm⁻¹，表示取樣或雷射有問題。驗收容差依藥典慣例取 ±1 cm⁻¹，兩者相差 50 倍，所以漂移可以被及早發現。","textEn":"An order-of-magnitude estimate of peak repeatability is σ_ν̃ ≈ FWHM/SNR: the polystyrene 1601 cm⁻¹ band appears about 8 cm⁻¹ wide at 4 cm⁻¹ resolution, so at a peak SNR of 500, σ_ν̃ ≈ 0.016 cm⁻¹; if the standard deviation of 10 consecutive runs is clearly above 0.02 cm⁻¹, sampling or laser trouble is indicated. The acceptance tolerance follows pharmacopoeia practice at ±1 cm⁻¹, 50 times larger, so drift can be caught early.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"]},{"id":"a431-v12-30-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「性能驗證、驗收準則與工程交接」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Performance qualification, acceptance criteria and handoff\", which statement holds?","options":["峰位重複性的量級估計為 σ_ν̃ ≈ FWHM/SNR：聚苯乙烯 1601 cm⁻¹ 譜帶在 4 cm⁻¹ 下的視線寬約 8 cm⁻¹，峰值訊雜比 500 時 σ_ν̃ ≈ 0.016 cm⁻¹。","MCT 偵測器在任何情況下都優於 DTGS，所以應該永遠使用 MCT。","因為有氦氖雷射，FTIR 的波數軸永遠不需要校正。"],"optionsEn":["An order-of-magnitude estimate of peak repeatability is σ_ν̃ ≈ FWHM/SNR: the polystyrene 1601 cm⁻¹ band appears about 8 cm⁻¹ wide at 4 cm⁻¹ resolution, so at a peak SNR of 500, σ_ν̃ ≈ 0.016 cm⁻¹.","An MCT detector is better than DTGS in every situation, so MCT should always be used.","Because of the HeNe laser, an FTIR wavenumber axis never needs calibration."],"answer":0,"explanation":"峰位重複性的量級估計為 σ_ν̃ ≈ FWHM/SNR：聚苯乙烯 1601 cm⁻¹ 譜帶在 4 cm⁻¹ 下的視線寬約 8 cm⁻¹，峰值訊雜比 500 時 σ_ν̃ ≈ 0.016 cm⁻¹；連續量 10 次的標準差若明顯大於 0.02 cm⁻¹，表示取樣或雷射有問題。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"An order-of-magnitude estimate of peak repeatability is σ_ν̃ ≈ FWHM/SNR: the polystyrene 1601 cm⁻¹ band appears about 8 cm⁻¹ wide at 4 cm⁻¹ resolution, so at a peak SNR of 500, σ_ν̃ ≈ 0.016 cm⁻¹; if the standard deviation of 10 consecutive runs is clearly above 0.02 cm⁻¹, sampling or laser trouble is indicated. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":30},{"id":"a431-v12-31","title":"性能驗證、驗收準則與工程交接：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Performance qualification, acceptance criteria and handoff: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"],"prerequisiteIds":["a431-v12-30"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「性能驗證報告」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Performance-qualification record” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"建立一份含日期、設定與結果的性能驗證表，每月重跑：聚苯乙烯峰位、解析度測試、100% 線雜訊、單光束能量、雷射與光源診斷值；把每項畫成管制圖，任何一項超出歷史平均 ±3σ 就啟動維修，而不是等到樣品結果異常。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Create a performance-qualification sheet with date, settings and results and rerun it monthly: polystyrene peak positions, the resolution test, 100% line noise, single-beam energy, laser and source diagnostics; plot each as a control chart and trigger maintenance when any item leaves its historical mean by ±3σ rather than waiting for abnormal sample results. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：維修人員更換分光鏡後只確認「有光譜」就交機，沒有重做聚苯乙烯校正與 100% 線，結果波數偏移 0.8 cm⁻¹、低波數端雜訊加倍，數月後資料庫比對全部失準。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: A technician replaces the beamsplitter, confirms only that a spectrum appears and returns the instrument without redoing the polystyrene calibration and 100% line; the wavenumber scale is off by 0.8 cm⁻¹ and low-wavenumber noise doubles, and months of library matching go wrong.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a431-v12-31-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"建立一份含日期、設定與結果的性能驗證表，每月重跑：聚苯乙烯峰位、解析度測試、100% 線雜訊、單光束能量、雷射與光源診斷值；把每項畫成管制圖，任何一項超出歷史平均 ±3σ 就啟動維修，而不是等到樣品結果異常。","textEn":"Create a performance-qualification sheet with date, settings and results and rerun it monthly: polystyrene peak positions, the resolution test, 100% line noise, single-beam energy, laser and source diagnostics; plot each as a control chart and trigger maintenance when any item leaves its historical mean by ±3σ rather than waiting for abnormal sample results.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"]},{"id":"a431-v12-31-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「性能驗證、驗收準則與工程交接」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Performance qualification, acceptance criteria and handoff\"?","options":["沿用另一台設備或另一個案例的量測結果，就可視為本系統已完成驗證。","建立一份含日期、設定與結果的性能驗證表，每月重跑：聚苯乙烯峰位、解析度測試、100% 線雜訊、單光束能量、雷射與光源診斷值。","解析度越高光譜越好，掃描次數只是為了美觀。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another instrument or another case counts as verifying this system.","Create a performance-qualification sheet with date, settings and results and rerun it monthly: polystyrene peak positions, the resolution test, 100% line noise, single-beam energy, laser and source diagnostics.","Higher resolution always gives a better spectrum, and scan averaging is merely cosmetic."],"answer":1,"explanation":"建立一份含日期、設定與結果的性能驗證表，每月重跑：聚苯乙烯峰位、解析度測試、100% 線雜訊、單光束能量、雷射與光源診斷值；把每項畫成管制圖，任何一項超出歷史平均 ±3σ 就啟動維修，而不是等到樣品結果異常。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Create a performance-qualification sheet with date, settings and results and rerun it monthly: polystyrene peak positions, the resolution test, 100% line noise, single-beam energy, laser and source diagnostics; plot each as a control chart and trigger maintenance when any item leaves its historical mean by ±3σ rather than waiting for abnormal sample results. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":31},{"id":"a431-v12-32","title":"性能驗證、驗收準則與工程交接：失效診斷","titleEn":"Performance qualification, acceptance criteria and handoff: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"],"prerequisiteIds":["a431-v12-31"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「性能驗證報告」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Performance-qualification record” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"維修人員更換分光鏡後只確認「有光譜」就交機，沒有重做聚苯乙烯校正與 100% 線，結果波數偏移 0.8 cm⁻¹、低波數端雜訊加倍，數月後資料庫比對全部失準。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"A technician replaces the beamsplitter, confirms only that a spectrum appears and returns the instrument without redoing the polystyrene calibration and 100% line; the wavenumber scale is off by 0.8 cm⁻¹ and low-wavenumber noise doubles, and months of library matching go wrong. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：這些數據連同光闌、速度、取樣倍率、切趾等設定一起寫入驗收報告，日後任何維修或漂移都與它比對。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: These results, together with aperture, velocity, sampling ratio and apodization settings, go into the qualification record against which every later repair or drift is compared.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「儀器自我診斷顯示綠燈，就等於通過性能驗證。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A green self-diagnostic light is the same as passing performance qualification.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a431-v12-32-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"維修人員更換分光鏡後只確認「有光譜」就交機，沒有重做聚苯乙烯校正與 100% 線，結果波數偏移 0.8 cm⁻¹、低波數端雜訊加倍，數月後資料庫比對全部失準。","textEn":"A technician replaces the beamsplitter, confirms only that a spectrum appears and returns the instrument without redoing the polystyrene calibration and 100% line; the wavenumber scale is off by 0.8 cm⁻¹ and low-wavenumber noise doubles, and months of library matching go wrong.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"]},{"id":"a431-v12-32-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「性能驗證、驗收準則與工程交接」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Performance qualification, acceptance criteria and handoff\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["調高增益或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數異常。","FTIR 是用某種精密光柵把紅外光分成各個波長後逐一量測。","維修人員更換分光鏡後只確認「有光譜」就交機，沒有重做聚苯乙烯校正與 100% 線，結果波數偏移 0.8 cm⁻¹、低波數端雜訊加倍，數月後資料庫比對全部失準。"],"optionsEn":["Raising the gain or widening the acceptance limits solves most anomalies.","An FTIR uses a fine grating to separate the infrared wavelengths and measures them one at a time.","A technician replaces the beamsplitter, confirms only that a spectrum appears and returns the instrument without redoing the polystyrene calibration and 100% line."],"answer":2,"explanation":"維修人員更換分光鏡後只確認「有光譜」就交機，沒有重做聚苯乙烯校正與 100% 線，結果波數偏移 0.8 cm⁻¹、低波數端雜訊加倍，數月後資料庫比對全部失準。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"A technician replaces the beamsplitter, confirms only that a spectrum appears and returns the instrument without redoing the polystyrene calibration and 100% line; the wavenumber scale is off by 0.8 cm⁻¹ and low-wavenumber noise doubles, and months of library matching go wrong. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":32}],"order":4}],"sourceIds":["v12o-thermo-ftir-intro-tn50674","v12o-bruker-ftir-routine","v12o-nist-srm-1921b","v12o-jasco-ir-spectrometer-fundamentals"],"curriculumVersion":12,"stepCount":32,"estimatedMinutes":800}};
